1
00:00:03,250 --> 00:02:03,250
Please contact turkision@gmail.com for any inquiries

2
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:08,030
No living creature was harmed during the
filming of this series.

3
00:02:08,690 --> 00:02:11,420
After two days

4
00:02:11,580 --> 00:02:14,010
Yenişehir

5
00:02:14,370 --> 00:02:17,400
Episode 103

6
00:02:21,185 --> 00:02:24,075
Wrist strength alone is not enough
to use a sword.

7
00:02:24,105 --> 00:02:26,345
You must keep your
feet firmly on the ground.

8
00:02:26,665 --> 00:02:28,455
Your movements are
weighed according to this.

9
00:02:28,455 --> 00:02:29,715
I know, Osman Bey.

10
00:02:31,545 --> 00:02:32,665
Besides, I'm not alone.

11
00:02:37,505 --> 00:02:38,895
Don't think we are all alone.

12
00:02:39,455 --> 00:02:42,005
We keep fighting, my Bey.

13
00:02:42,285 --> 00:02:43,635
This is my pleasure.

14
00:02:43,675 --> 00:02:45,035
Come and see.

15
00:03:02,935 --> 00:03:04,505
Alps.

16
00:03:18,575 --> 00:03:20,155
Tell me now.

17
00:03:20,875 --> 00:03:22,205
Orhan.

18
00:03:22,935 --> 00:03:24,395
What made you look back?

19
00:03:24,425 --> 00:03:27,435
I wanted to see if there was a
warrior behind me or not, father.

20
00:03:27,575 --> 00:03:30,015
I won't ignore.

21
00:03:33,095 --> 00:03:34,465
Aladdin.

22
00:03:34,545 --> 00:03:35,935
You tell me.

23
00:03:36,085 --> 00:03:38,075
Why didn't you look behind?

24
00:03:38,105 --> 00:03:41,605
You will not ask for Alps to support you
while you are training your sons.

25
00:03:42,525 --> 00:03:45,435
You weren't supposed to waste my move.

26
00:03:49,385 --> 00:03:51,725
You are like the fingers of one hand.

27
00:03:52,785 --> 00:03:55,555
They become one fist together.

28
00:03:55,955 --> 00:03:58,355
And you strike the heart of the infidels.

29
00:03:58,385 --> 00:03:59,965
Who are we going to hit?

30
00:04:00,665 --> 00:04:02,305
First, me.

31
00:04:03,875 --> 00:04:05,095
Come here.

32
00:04:05,725 --> 00:04:08,045
We will not allow you to
defeat us, Osman Bey.

33
00:04:08,365 --> 00:04:10,725
Brother, fight well.

34
00:04:23,525 --> 00:04:25,465
We fought well.

35
00:04:25,965 --> 00:04:28,165
While you were trying to protect
yourself from the dagger...

36
00:04:28,165 --> 00:04:29,975
you left your neck unprotected,father.

37
00:04:30,285 --> 00:04:31,965
Mashallah!

38
00:04:32,445 --> 00:04:33,675
Mashallah!

39
00:04:34,255 --> 00:04:35,995
War is a trick.

40
00:04:36,225 --> 00:04:37,665
Yes.

41
00:04:37,845 --> 00:04:39,415
But your dagger is useless.

42
00:04:46,495 --> 00:04:47,655
Boys.

43
00:04:48,835 --> 00:04:51,705
The enemy plots in this way.

44
00:04:52,475 --> 00:04:56,125
But we are the ones who
will knit the biggest game.

45
00:04:57,025 --> 00:04:58,415
You are ready now.

46
00:05:00,485 --> 00:05:02,355
There is no use in their
traps, my Bey.

47
00:05:02,505 --> 00:05:04,635
We took refuge for the good of the scheming.

48
00:05:06,415 --> 00:05:08,095
Hear me well now.

49
00:05:13,945 --> 00:05:15,455
Sons of the North.

50
00:05:15,615 --> 00:05:17,405
Get ready...

51
00:05:18,075 --> 00:05:20,085
for the black curse to embrace you.

52
00:05:20,455 --> 00:05:22,525
Make offerings to Odin.

53
00:05:23,535 --> 00:05:26,165
Valhalla will open the doors for you.

54
00:05:26,375 --> 00:05:41,965
Black curse!

55
00:05:58,815 --> 00:06:04,295
The court that will be held will
kill Öktem and his daughter.

56
00:06:05,695 --> 00:06:07,465
It's all thanks to you.

57
00:06:08,185 --> 00:06:10,025
My beautiful lover.

58
00:06:10,285 --> 00:06:13,625
Shh, the ground will hear, lover.

59
00:06:14,525 --> 00:06:16,075
Öktem raided the village.

60
00:06:17,165 --> 00:06:19,045
And his daughter attacked Subasi.

61
00:06:20,365 --> 00:06:21,745
What did we do?

62
00:06:25,035 --> 00:06:26,725
I will join the trial.

63
00:06:27,135 --> 00:06:31,625
The court's decision
will spark a civil war.

64
00:06:33,065 --> 00:06:38,875
Osman will get caught between me and
the civil war, and be crushed.

65
00:06:41,015 --> 00:06:44,775
This civil war will be the beginning
of realizing our dreams.

66
00:06:45,725 --> 00:06:47,225
I'll take Yenişehir.

67
00:06:47,965 --> 00:06:50,455
How are you going to do this while Osman
is in town?

68
00:06:50,545 --> 00:06:51,735
You will see.

69
00:06:52,595 --> 00:06:54,575
I will kick Osman out of the city.

70
00:06:55,085 --> 00:06:56,825
I will destroy him outside.

71
00:06:57,005 --> 00:07:00,395
And Yenişehir will burn
with the fire of my anger.

72
00:07:01,005 --> 00:07:04,745
Kantakuzenos will only come out alive.

73
00:07:04,955 --> 00:07:07,525
Why do you give Cantakosanos
so much importance?

74
00:07:08,185 --> 00:07:09,515
I'm jealous.

75
00:07:09,845 --> 00:07:11,215
Oh Olof.

76
00:07:11,345 --> 00:07:13,465
This is the way to make my
dreams come true.

77
00:07:14,135 --> 00:07:19,285
His empire
will give me all the armies of Rome.

78
00:07:19,535 --> 00:07:22,445
Forget all the famous leaders you know.

79
00:07:23,135 --> 00:07:28,875
History will only write
about Olof's revenge.

80
00:07:31,985 --> 00:07:33,755
Osman is the beginning.

81
00:07:35,215 --> 00:07:38,535
No civilization will remain that
will not be afraid of my shadow.

82
00:07:44,075 --> 00:07:45,435
Soldiers!

83
00:08:08,125 --> 00:08:09,435
You are...

84
00:08:10,275 --> 00:08:14,105
the giant wave that destroys
empires, Olof.

85
00:08:14,375 --> 00:08:20,225
Everyone is helpless in front of you, my love.

86
00:08:23,615 --> 00:08:29,395
Today, you will burn Yenisehir.

87
00:08:30,665 --> 00:08:31,845
Boys.

88
00:08:32,825 --> 00:08:34,985
They will want to burn Yenişehir.

89
00:08:35,605 --> 00:08:37,495
But we will not allow this.

90
00:08:39,255 --> 00:08:43,735
It's time to test what you learned in
this training through a great war.

91
00:08:45,025 --> 00:08:47,425
Our future is tied to this war of mind.

92
00:08:52,425 --> 00:08:53,615
We will be one body.

93
00:08:54,665 --> 00:08:56,285
And one mind.

94
00:08:57,555 --> 00:09:00,405
While one of you confuse their minds...

95
00:09:02,755 --> 00:09:04,925
the other will hit their bodies.

96
00:09:07,055 --> 00:09:08,785
I will cut off their heads.

97
00:09:10,125 --> 00:09:11,515
But boys...

98
00:09:11,655 --> 00:09:14,225
The main burden will be on your shoulders.

99
00:09:14,685 --> 00:09:17,315
If you aren't there, there will be no move.

100
00:09:18,425 --> 00:09:21,265
If there is a mistake, there
will be no victory.

101
00:09:25,625 --> 00:09:28,665
They want to hit us with our
justice, don't they, father?

102
00:09:29,655 --> 00:09:32,035
Shall we allow this?
Will they be able to hit us?

103
00:09:32,855 --> 00:09:34,575
They will.

104
00:09:34,575 --> 00:09:36,805
They will even start a civil war.

105
00:09:37,445 --> 00:09:40,085
While they think they have
achieved their goals...

106
00:09:40,885 --> 00:09:43,145
the arena will be ours.

107
00:09:43,995 --> 00:09:46,605
Whoever succeeds in his plan
will weaken his defenses.

108
00:09:46,755 --> 00:09:50,905
Whoever loosens his defenses, his
neck will be under our swords.

109
00:09:53,065 --> 00:09:54,585
Come here.

110
00:09:58,235 --> 00:10:00,065
Get ready.

111
00:10:02,275 --> 00:10:03,495
Come on.

112
00:10:12,385 --> 00:10:14,025
The arrow has come out of
the bow, Beys.

113
00:10:14,855 --> 00:10:17,565
If a death sentence is issued
by the court today...

114
00:10:18,105 --> 00:10:22,125
we will go to Yenişehir and take our Bey.

115
00:10:22,285 --> 00:10:24,815
I stand with you, Bengi Hatun.

116
00:10:25,315 --> 00:10:28,195
We will not allow Öktem Bey to become
a victim of slander.

117
00:10:28,685 --> 00:10:30,275
We are with you.

118
00:10:32,035 --> 00:10:35,595
So, stay in the tribe and wait for news from me.

119
00:10:37,075 --> 00:10:42,105
Let's see whether Osman Bey will believe
the words of the infidels or Öktem Bey.

120
00:10:51,725 --> 00:10:53,465
Our shepherd has come.

121
00:10:54,085 --> 00:10:57,405
It is clear that Malhun Hatun
was suspicious and did not stand still.

122
00:10:57,575 --> 00:10:59,935
We are not a herd of sheep, Beys.

123
00:11:00,275 --> 00:11:02,155
We are a pack of wolves.

124
00:11:04,055 --> 00:11:06,865
You know what to do if necessary

125
00:11:13,495 --> 00:11:14,675
Bengi Hatun.

126
00:11:14,985 --> 00:11:16,375
Come, Turgut Bey.

127
00:11:24,225 --> 00:11:25,935
You put my Bey in danger.

128
00:11:26,545 --> 00:11:29,475
Come and sit.

129
00:11:30,145 --> 00:11:31,985
Your coming is never a good sign.

130
00:11:32,395 --> 00:11:35,125
We have no eye for
his position, Bengi Hatun.

131
00:11:35,235 --> 00:11:37,035
We are here for justice.

132
00:11:37,065 --> 00:11:39,255
You want to say you are
asking for our heads.

133
00:11:43,555 --> 00:11:45,655
Why are you here, Uraz Bey?

134
00:11:48,515 --> 00:11:49,925
And you, Şahin Bey?

135
00:11:51,865 --> 00:11:53,245
What are you doing?

136
00:11:54,045 --> 00:11:55,595
Let's see if you have a problem

137
00:11:55,965 --> 00:11:57,745
It's a black day, Turgut Bey.

138
00:11:58,865 --> 00:12:02,135
A friend must stand by you on a dark day.

139
00:12:05,585 --> 00:12:08,145
Tell us why you came.

140
00:12:08,455 --> 00:12:10,675
Until the court's decision...

141
00:12:11,235 --> 00:12:13,465
I will stay in the tribe with my Alps.

142
00:12:14,015 --> 00:12:17,725
Beware that no one thinks or
does anything until then.

143
00:12:20,155 --> 00:12:24,635
Justice will decide whether
a day is black or white.

144
00:12:24,825 --> 00:12:27,065
Damn your justice.

145
00:12:28,525 --> 00:12:30,345
If you had justice...

146
00:12:31,545 --> 00:12:35,705
you wouldn't put my husband and daughter
in the cell.

147
00:12:38,825 --> 00:12:42,985
You would put infidels under the dirt.

148
00:12:45,495 --> 00:12:46,785
Alps!

149
00:12:47,755 --> 00:12:49,025
Prepare my horse.

150
00:12:50,165 --> 00:12:51,655
We'll go to court.

151
00:12:55,145 --> 00:12:57,245
Our tribe is your trust, Beys.

152
00:12:58,145 --> 00:12:59,405
Wait for news from me.

153
00:13:04,055 --> 00:13:06,135
Never worry, Bengi Hatun.

154
00:13:07,905 --> 00:13:12,705
Your tribe and your Alps are my trust.

155
00:13:14,375 --> 00:13:16,305
Go now.

156
00:13:16,335 --> 00:13:17,755
Go to court.

157
00:13:34,835 --> 00:13:35,975
Come on.

158
00:14:08,685 --> 00:14:10,445
My gold pieces...

159
00:14:11,505 --> 00:14:14,365
are going to Constantinople, huh?

160
00:14:15,005 --> 00:14:16,895
Yes, my Bey.

161
00:14:18,595 --> 00:14:22,995
Well, shall I leave her
love for someone else?

162
00:14:28,595 --> 00:14:31,045
We will get to them at the right time.

163
00:14:32,205 --> 00:14:33,975
Get behind the caravan quickly.

164
00:14:38,515 --> 00:14:40,835
Let the court be held.

165
00:14:41,755 --> 00:14:45,235
Let's wait for Osman's lands to be a mess.

166
00:14:46,085 --> 00:14:52,475
And I will become the richest
merchant in the West and the East.

167
00:14:53,685 --> 00:14:55,595
You will become, my Bey.

168
00:14:56,315 --> 00:14:58,515
And you will see me too, Inshallah.

169
00:14:58,945 --> 00:15:02,915
I shouldn't see you now in order
to see you then.

170
00:15:06,145 --> 00:15:08,115
I put you on a mission, Hüseyin, come on.

171
00:15:08,115 --> 00:15:09,375
Your command, my Bey.

172
00:15:16,055 --> 00:15:19,205
Sir, you are used to
passing judgment in your tent...

173
00:15:19,205 --> 00:15:21,455
and ensuring justice through tradition.

174
00:15:26,055 --> 00:15:29,625
Will you be able to remain silent in court
and abide by my judgment?

175
00:15:33,575 --> 00:15:35,345
What makes you suspicious?

176
00:15:41,665 --> 00:15:42,955
You come from Konya.

177
00:15:44,305 --> 00:15:46,655
Is Konya's justice better than us?

178
00:15:46,985 --> 00:15:48,355
No, my Bey.

179
00:15:48,695 --> 00:15:51,855
Every place governed by Sharia is equal.

180
00:15:51,955 --> 00:15:53,025
No.

181
00:15:53,445 --> 00:15:55,105
You think...

182
00:15:55,545 --> 00:15:57,865
I will deviate from justice.

183
00:16:00,335 --> 00:16:03,375
You think I won't remain silent
and get involved in court.

184
00:16:04,645 --> 00:16:06,395
Don't worry.

185
00:16:08,195 --> 00:16:09,995
I am the sword of justice.

186
00:16:10,445 --> 00:16:12,475
And you are the pen of justice.

187
00:16:16,235 --> 00:16:18,225
It will be under your control.

188
00:16:18,715 --> 00:16:21,055
What will be fixed, will be fixed by you.

189
00:16:21,395 --> 00:16:22,715
Thank you, my Bey.

190
00:16:30,785 --> 00:16:34,905
And I will take revenge on the heathens.

191
00:16:38,015 --> 00:16:42,885
The trial of what I do takes
place on the battlefield.

192
00:16:48,115 --> 00:16:49,835
The case is yours.

193
00:16:50,555 --> 00:16:53,235
I trust that you will judge with justice.

194
00:16:53,685 --> 00:16:54,925
Thank you.

195
00:16:54,935 --> 00:16:56,625
Thank you, my Bey.

196
00:16:59,965 --> 00:17:01,605
However, don't you...

197
00:17:03,385 --> 00:17:05,815
compare us to others.

198
00:17:08,815 --> 00:17:11,464
We will be remembered for our
judgment of the world...

199
00:17:11,545 --> 00:17:15,175
and the justice we spread to the world.

200
00:17:19,045 --> 00:17:20,055
Thank you.

201
00:17:23,615 --> 00:17:25,194
Come on.

202
00:17:49,095 --> 00:17:50,465
Öktem.

203
00:17:50,495 --> 00:17:51,795
Alçiçek.

204
00:17:53,355 --> 00:17:54,695
I will save you.

205
00:17:54,825 --> 00:17:56,835
I swear I will save you.

206
00:17:57,035 --> 00:17:58,965
We will not succumb to slanders, mother.

207
00:17:59,035 --> 00:18:00,515
What they did will not go unpunished.

208
00:18:00,555 --> 00:18:02,525
You definitely won't give up.

209
00:18:02,615 --> 00:18:05,925
I'll burn this city
for a single hair of yours.

210
00:18:06,765 --> 00:18:08,005
Hatun.

211
00:18:13,065 --> 00:18:15,075
Don't make a mistake.

212
00:18:21,365 --> 00:18:22,465
Let's go

213
00:18:31,625 --> 00:18:35,495
When the court is over, tell the Beys.

214
00:18:37,105 --> 00:18:39,385
The arrow that came out
of the bow will pierce.

215
00:18:49,995 --> 00:18:51,275
Ayşe Hatun.

216
00:18:51,435 --> 00:18:54,055
Yes, Ayşe Hatun.

217
00:18:54,695 --> 00:18:59,695
Ayşe Hatun, mother of Aktemur, whom
your rebellious daughter wanted to kill.

218
00:19:01,025 --> 00:19:03,535
Go on your way, Hatun.

219
00:19:03,645 --> 00:19:05,145
I have a lot of worries.

220
00:19:05,185 --> 00:19:06,575
Look at me.

221
00:19:07,225 --> 00:19:09,085
Your daughter did something wrong.

222
00:19:09,085 --> 00:19:12,335
You didn't hold her rope as her mother.

223
00:19:13,305 --> 00:19:16,555
Look at what you are saying
instead of asking for forgiveness.

224
00:19:18,325 --> 00:19:21,245
What do you mean when you say
you didn't catch her rope, Hatun?

225
00:19:21,245 --> 00:19:24,165
I don't consider my daughter a dog
as you do as I won't grab her rope. (discipline her)

226
00:19:24,165 --> 00:19:25,255
Hatun.

227
00:19:31,195 --> 00:19:33,845
The one you are talking
about is not only Ayşe's son...

228
00:19:33,845 --> 00:19:35,795
he is the Subasi of the state.

229
00:19:37,175 --> 00:19:38,855
Weigh your words, then speak.

230
00:19:39,105 --> 00:19:41,345
You won't be able to take it anymore.

231
00:19:41,645 --> 00:19:45,185
My back bear the pain of losing a brother.

232
00:19:45,645 --> 00:19:48,415
And bear the burden of slander.

233
00:19:48,845 --> 00:19:53,415
Let me decide for myself what
I'm going to say, Malhun Hatun.

234
00:19:53,645 --> 00:19:55,875
Say what you want in your tribe.

235
00:19:56,105 --> 00:19:58,005
But this place is my city.

236
00:20:00,135 --> 00:20:04,665
Shut up if you don't want to go
to prison like the rest of your family.

237
00:20:09,655 --> 00:20:12,095
The same applies to you, Ayşe Hatun.

238
00:20:44,865 --> 00:20:47,055
The smell of blood.

239
00:20:53,465 --> 00:20:54,725
Tell the Beys.

240
00:20:55,265 --> 00:20:57,935
Today, we will not just save our Bey.

241
00:20:59,045 --> 00:21:01,005
We will take revenge too.

242
00:21:01,405 --> 00:21:03,125
Let them know this.

243
00:21:43,855 --> 00:21:45,985
Will you excuse me, Aktemur?

244
00:21:47,175 --> 00:21:48,295
Come in.

245
00:21:50,045 --> 00:21:54,185
Where do you go before
your wound is healed, my Bey?

246
00:21:56,935 --> 00:21:59,135
Kumral Abdad said you should rest.

247
00:21:59,975 --> 00:22:01,705
Is there any news about Alçiçek?

248
00:22:02,185 --> 00:22:03,185
Do not you dare!

249
00:22:03,235 --> 00:22:05,835
Don't say
her name in front of your mother, my Bey.

250
00:22:07,065 --> 00:22:08,645
Say it, Ülgen Hatun.

251
00:22:08,795 --> 00:22:10,195
Where's Alçiçek?

252
00:22:10,355 --> 00:22:11,905
Don't lose your mind..

253
00:22:12,875 --> 00:22:14,445
She's brought to the palace.

254
00:22:14,495 --> 00:22:15,435
To the palace?

255
00:22:15,435 --> 00:22:16,865
But you didn't hear from me.

256
00:22:17,045 --> 00:22:19,095
Say, where is she now?

257
00:22:19,315 --> 00:22:20,695
My Bey.

258
00:22:27,865 --> 00:22:29,605
Your wound hasn't healed yet.

259
00:22:29,695 --> 00:22:31,795
This is not the time
for you to be stubborn.

260
00:22:32,905 --> 00:22:36,285
Are you going after that girl
who tried to kill you again?

261
00:22:36,435 --> 00:22:37,765
Mother.

262
00:22:38,685 --> 00:22:40,785
I don't believe Alçiçek hurt me.

263
00:22:44,045 --> 00:22:47,295
How did you blind your eyes?

264
00:22:48,095 --> 00:22:51,985
The girl stabbed you, Aktemur.

265
00:22:53,275 --> 00:22:55,465
You haven't opened your
eyes for a whole day.

266
00:22:55,465 --> 00:22:56,905
What are you saying?

267
00:23:01,225 --> 00:23:03,235
If the arrow got here...

268
00:23:03,385 --> 00:23:05,105
Look, just one finger.

269
00:23:05,515 --> 00:23:08,175
If it got here, you'd die.

270
00:23:12,095 --> 00:23:16,255
Not your wound, but your funeral...
Don't make me say it!

271
00:23:18,685 --> 00:23:21,045
We meet in court, mother.

272
00:23:42,305 --> 00:23:43,735
Salam Alaikum.

273
00:23:43,865 --> 00:23:45,275
Alaikum Salam.

274
00:23:57,405 --> 00:23:59,275
Where are you coming from, Clerk?

275
00:23:59,545 --> 00:24:01,255
We face the rebels.

276
00:24:01,285 --> 00:24:02,995
I did my job and came.

277
00:24:09,695 --> 00:24:10,955
My Alaaddin.

278
00:24:11,515 --> 00:24:14,435
The trial has not started yet, what
are you writing?

279
00:24:14,895 --> 00:24:17,345
I write the date...

280
00:24:17,375 --> 00:24:20,955
for the trial, Malhun mother.

281
00:24:21,315 --> 00:24:22,645
Mashallah.

282
00:24:33,765 --> 00:24:36,495
Sit here, Ayşe Hatun.

283
00:25:28,495 --> 00:25:31,155
Osman Bey's loyal soldiers.

284
00:25:32,235 --> 00:25:34,065
The word "soldier" is said to your men.

285
00:25:34,545 --> 00:25:36,615
We are called Alps.

286
00:25:37,595 --> 00:25:39,185
No difference.

287
00:25:39,795 --> 00:25:42,245
It is enough that you do
not appear in front of me.

288
00:25:45,775 --> 00:25:49,115
You are not allowed to enter
Osman Bey's palace with your swords.

289
00:26:12,615 --> 00:26:13,975
Let's go

290
00:26:13,995 --> 00:26:15,325
Come on.

291
00:27:22,055 --> 00:27:23,625
Where is Osman Bey?

292
00:27:24,425 --> 00:27:26,245
My Bey comes when he wants.

293
00:27:26,825 --> 00:27:27,835
Go.

294
00:27:58,165 --> 00:28:00,035
Where is Kantakuzenos?

295
00:28:17,885 --> 00:28:20,195
Oh, the world for which we perished...

296
00:28:21,755 --> 00:28:24,195
Murderers are hosted in the palace.

297
00:28:25,325 --> 00:28:27,865
Look at how Beys are treated.

298
00:28:29,945 --> 00:28:31,195
Okay, then.

299
00:28:31,505 --> 00:28:38,315
You should have thought about that before you ordered
your soldiers to raid my village, Öktem.

300
00:28:40,775 --> 00:28:42,855
What you deserve is to be killed.

301
00:29:00,485 --> 00:29:02,035
Time to go home.

302
00:29:08,315 --> 00:29:09,475
Osman Bey.

303
00:29:09,575 --> 00:29:11,225
We're going to court, right?

304
00:29:11,265 --> 00:29:13,015
I think I've waited long enough.

305
00:29:13,385 --> 00:29:15,015
You will not come to court.

306
00:29:16,815 --> 00:29:19,815
What does that mean?
I'm here for that court.

307
00:29:20,175 --> 00:29:22,445
- Emperor...
- You are heir to the throne.

308
00:29:23,735 --> 00:29:25,215
Your first job is not to die.

309
00:29:27,635 --> 00:29:29,655
That woman named Frigg and Olof...

310
00:29:30,305 --> 00:29:32,395
They might try to kill you in court.

311
00:29:34,735 --> 00:29:37,205
I will not give up my mission out of fear.

312
00:29:37,565 --> 00:29:38,845
I'm the one who got hurt.

313
00:29:40,545 --> 00:29:43,225
And what was stolen is my gold
and the village is mine.

314
00:29:43,325 --> 00:29:44,935
But you are in lands.

315
00:29:46,035 --> 00:29:48,535
The health of my guest matters to me.

316
00:29:49,315 --> 00:29:50,595
Do not worry.

317
00:29:50,655 --> 00:29:54,145
You will go to Constantinople in good
health when justice is served.

318
00:29:56,475 --> 00:29:59,555
Osman Bey, this is the
last time I trust you.

319
00:30:01,555 --> 00:30:02,795
When you don't trust me...

320
00:30:04,655 --> 00:30:07,015
know that death will be right behind you.

321
00:30:16,605 --> 00:30:19,365
Open, I have something to
ask Alçiçek Hatun.

322
00:30:21,205 --> 00:30:23,595
- Subasi...
- I said open, Ayaz Alp.

323
00:30:47,875 --> 00:30:49,195
Subasi.

324
00:30:52,085 --> 00:30:53,625
Alçiçek.

325
00:30:58,155 --> 00:30:59,855
You are fine, right?

326
00:31:03,785 --> 00:31:06,085
I'm not, Alçiçek.

327
00:31:18,755 --> 00:31:20,295
I did not do it.

328
00:31:21,015 --> 00:31:22,235
I know.

329
00:31:24,745 --> 00:31:26,105
You...

330
00:31:28,075 --> 00:31:30,655
Be sure that I will let everyone
know your innocence.

331
00:31:31,915 --> 00:31:34,665
You were saying me to
trust the justice of Osman Bey.

332
00:31:35,215 --> 00:31:38,685
That justice is now putting the noose
on my father's neck, Subasi.

333
00:31:46,665 --> 00:31:48,215
If I had a thousand necks...

334
00:31:52,795 --> 00:31:55,895
I would sacrifice them all to stop the
tears in your eyes.

335
00:31:57,845 --> 00:32:02,695
But I'm handcuffed
in front of justice, Alçiçek.

336
00:32:03,875 --> 00:32:05,655
I'm saying my dad will die.

337
00:32:05,745 --> 00:32:07,815
I say he will die without guilt, don't
you understand?

338
00:32:07,865 --> 00:32:10,865
He won't die, he won't die, Alçiçek.

339
00:32:11,825 --> 00:32:13,675
Trust in the justice of Osman Bey.

340
00:32:19,365 --> 00:32:21,155
Don't, Alçiçek.

341
00:32:26,805 --> 00:32:28,345
Don't be angry.

342
00:32:31,005 --> 00:32:32,555
Don't.

343
00:32:35,275 --> 00:32:37,105
Save my father, Subasi.

344
00:32:38,535 --> 00:32:40,095
Save my father.

345
00:32:44,955 --> 00:32:46,945
Justice will be served today.

346
00:32:48,225 --> 00:32:51,475
You will live the same fate as your men
who raided my village, Öktem.

347
00:32:51,615 --> 00:32:53,435
Don't worry, you dog.

348
00:32:54,035 --> 00:32:55,765
Their destiny is martyrdom.

349
00:32:57,015 --> 00:32:58,585
Martyrdom is a grace for us.

350
00:32:59,985 --> 00:33:01,745
You will be punished.

351
00:33:02,345 --> 00:33:05,245
You will drown in the blood
of the innocents you killed.

352
00:33:05,715 --> 00:33:07,725
Today or tomorrow.

353
00:33:10,595 --> 00:33:11,895
Aren't Osman Bey coming?

354
00:33:11,895 --> 00:33:13,895
Osman Bey is coming.

355
00:33:14,455 --> 00:33:15,835
Stop asking.

356
00:33:16,465 --> 00:33:19,245
The court is the only
one who will ask questions today.

357
00:33:29,965 --> 00:33:31,635
Where is Kantakuzenos?

358
00:33:31,975 --> 00:33:34,055
Waiting for his wound to heal.

359
00:33:34,795 --> 00:33:37,175
He was the target of a woman named Frigg.

360
00:33:39,265 --> 00:33:41,495
For this reason, I keep
him in a safe place.

361
00:33:42,845 --> 00:33:44,985
Isn't your testimony enough?

362
00:33:45,545 --> 00:33:52,155
My testimony is enough to burn
the entire tribe of Öktem.

363
00:33:56,415 --> 00:33:59,085
And there is an injury of
Kantakuzenos as well.

364
00:33:59,655 --> 00:34:01,655
He'll be punished for doing that too.

365
00:34:02,225 --> 00:34:04,085
The punishment for all this is death.

366
00:34:04,805 --> 00:34:06,325
Dog!

367
00:34:06,885 --> 00:34:10,045
I didn't hit Cantakozanos and I
didn't raid the village.

368
00:34:11,895 --> 00:34:14,295
Every breath you take is contempt for me!

369
00:34:14,304 --> 00:34:17,793
Justice will be served and
you will die, Öktem.

370
00:34:17,925 --> 00:34:21,235
I will cut off your head with
my own hands.

371
00:34:21,435 --> 00:34:24,445
Otherwise, I will do my justice myself.

372
00:34:24,505 --> 00:34:25,784
Shut up!

373
00:34:30,415 --> 00:34:32,445
This court was held for justice.

374
00:34:39,085 --> 00:34:40,114
Öktem Bey.

375
00:34:41,574 --> 00:34:43,114
Stop disobedience.

376
00:34:45,455 --> 00:34:46,864
Shut up now.

377
00:34:55,554 --> 00:34:58,655
And you will
submit your testimony.

378
00:35:00,195 --> 00:35:04,715
But if you try to achieve
justice on your own...

379
00:35:05,945 --> 00:35:08,805
Your head will not go to
Constantinople with your body.

380
00:35:16,545 --> 00:35:19,825
- Salam Alaikum.
- Alaikum Salam.

381
00:35:30,085 --> 00:35:34,335
I turn my back on the customary
laws of our traditions.

382
00:35:35,025 --> 00:35:41,975
I guide my way through the
legal laws of Qur’an and I judge by them.

383
00:35:43,775 --> 00:35:46,655
Our court does not stand by anyone.

384
00:35:47,405 --> 00:35:53,655
It's charged with achieving justice without
regard to anyone's religion or lineage.

385
00:35:55,555 --> 00:35:59,415
I'll start the trial, sit down.

386
00:36:19,065 --> 00:36:25,935
A cursed incident occurred on the
3rd of the month of Safar at Akça.

387
00:36:27,225 --> 00:36:30,765
The truth will come out today.

388
00:36:32,195 --> 00:36:35,565
Whoever did the wrong will be punished.

389
00:36:38,375 --> 00:36:42,355
Commander Olof, we're listening to you.

390
00:36:42,675 --> 00:36:50,295
Öktem Bey has given an order to
kill more than 50 innocent people.

391
00:36:51,635 --> 00:36:53,985
He plundered Rome's golds.

392
00:36:54,985 --> 00:36:59,175
The prince Kantakuzenos
was infected in his tribe.

393
00:37:01,985 --> 00:37:07,585
Only the soul can pay the
price for all these sins.

394
00:37:09,585 --> 00:37:12,165
We decide this, Olof.

395
00:37:18,605 --> 00:37:20,595
What's your defense, Öktem Bey?

396
00:37:21,885 --> 00:37:23,575
I said it before too...

397
00:37:26,215 --> 00:37:27,875
They said I raided the village.

398
00:37:28,655 --> 00:37:32,585
My Alps were on a mission there.

399
00:37:34,455 --> 00:37:36,635
They said gold was found in your tribe.

400
00:37:36,685 --> 00:37:39,875
I don't know about any of these things.

401
00:37:41,035 --> 00:37:43,265
I have complete confidence in the court.

402
00:37:43,395 --> 00:37:48,835
But true justice is in the afterlife.

403
00:37:50,055 --> 00:37:53,615
And there I will hold the collar
of those who sowed sedition.

404
00:38:11,745 --> 00:38:15,395
Be ready, our anger awaits them.

405
00:38:41,235 --> 00:38:44,435
Now, attack!

406
00:38:57,205 --> 00:38:59,595
My Bey, what's going on?
Who are they?

407
00:39:00,685 --> 00:39:03,565
Bayındır Bey knows good gold.

408
00:39:03,635 --> 00:39:06,755
The whole world is after
what he set its sights on.

409
00:39:06,855 --> 00:39:08,855
Let's let them kill each other.

410
00:39:21,195 --> 00:39:25,075
- Salam Alaikum.
- Alaikum Salam.

411
00:39:37,515 --> 00:39:40,175
Charges have been filed.

412
00:39:41,175 --> 00:39:45,695
In order to make a decision,
the other case must be heard.

413
00:39:46,855 --> 00:39:50,705
Subasi Aktemur Bey,
we are listening to you

414
00:39:58,635 --> 00:40:03,365
I first tried to kill the captive.

415
00:40:05,285 --> 00:40:06,485
I stood in front of her.

416
00:40:09,485 --> 00:40:10,645
She stabbed me.

417
00:40:13,945 --> 00:40:15,755
But not on purpose.

418
00:40:18,065 --> 00:40:22,565
While she wanted to kill the
captive, I walked in between them.

419
00:40:27,295 --> 00:40:31,985
I wanted to know the link between the captive
and those dogs who killed my uncle.

420
00:40:32,515 --> 00:40:35,635
Don't speak before you are
allowed to speak, Alçiçek Hatun.

421
00:40:38,045 --> 00:40:39,855
Alçiçek Hatun is innocent.

422
00:40:40,175 --> 00:40:45,405
The guilt is committed to the
state, not to you, Aktemur Bey.

423
00:40:47,175 --> 00:40:49,095
You can't make up your mind.

424
00:40:51,795 --> 00:40:54,165
As long as I am the Subasi...

425
00:40:55,595 --> 00:41:00,005
As long as I represent the state...

426
00:41:01,655 --> 00:41:09,155
I say that this crime
was not committed against me.

427
00:41:11,525 --> 00:41:15,815
She says she stuck the dagger
by mistake, what about the arrow?

428
00:41:16,615 --> 00:41:19,605
If it deviated a little, you'd lose
your soul, Subasi.

429
00:41:19,655 --> 00:41:22,465
Shall I command you to be
silent one by one, Ayşe Hatun?

430
00:41:22,975 --> 00:41:24,175
Silence!

431
00:41:29,995 --> 00:41:32,655
What do you say about the
arrow incident, Aktemur Bey?

432
00:41:33,265 --> 00:41:34,545
I did not see the archer.

433
00:41:35,545 --> 00:41:40,185
The only thing I know is that I was
wounded by Alçiçek Hatun's arrow.

434
00:41:43,645 --> 00:41:46,455
Bala Hatun, what do you say?

435
00:41:50,645 --> 00:41:52,995
When we found Aktemur injured...

436
00:41:55,775 --> 00:41:58,925
We caught the Alçiçek near him.

437
00:42:01,375 --> 00:42:05,925
The arrow and the bow were in the
hands of the Alçiçek, Judge Dursun.

438
00:42:08,145 --> 00:42:09,725
Alçiçek Hatun.

439
00:42:10,425 --> 00:42:13,195
Do you have a defense against
what is said?

440
00:42:16,065 --> 00:42:18,315
As Subasi told you...

441
00:42:19,335 --> 00:42:21,085
I am not the one who shot
the arrow.

442
00:42:21,105 --> 00:42:23,085
Someone hit me on the head.

443
00:42:23,085 --> 00:42:25,455
When I opened my eyes, the bow
was in my hand.

444
00:42:25,575 --> 00:42:28,195
That liar.

445
00:42:28,875 --> 00:42:30,435
You're lying.

446
00:42:30,495 --> 00:42:31,695
She is lying.

447
00:42:31,725 --> 00:42:33,355
It's over, Ayşe Hatun.

448
00:42:33,525 --> 00:42:34,725
Get out.

449
00:42:55,155 --> 00:42:56,705
Osman Bey.

450
00:42:57,085 --> 00:42:58,965
Do you have anything to say?

451
00:43:00,175 --> 00:43:02,425
I have not witnessed this incident.

452
00:43:07,125 --> 00:43:11,265
But of course, I can not accept the
attack on the Subasi of Yenişehir...

453
00:43:11,275 --> 00:43:15,955
my guest, Kantakuzenos.

454
00:43:18,275 --> 00:43:20,325
There is no judgment for me in this court.

455
00:43:21,865 --> 00:43:23,995
You are the decision-maker, Judge Dursun.

456
00:43:32,475 --> 00:43:39,725
Alçiçek Hatun's first attack on Subasi
Aktemur Bey sets a precedent for the second.

457
00:43:41,695 --> 00:43:46,575
The penalty is 5-years of exile.

458
00:43:49,295 --> 00:43:50,675
However...

459
00:43:52,525 --> 00:43:56,875
as the offense was committed
against Subasi...

460
00:43:57,395 --> 00:44:00,135
it's considered that it
was committed against the state.

461
00:44:00,245 --> 00:44:03,795
The period of exile was
increased to 10 years.

462
00:44:22,545 --> 00:44:24,675
I will not allow this.

463
00:44:27,815 --> 00:44:29,365
And as for Öktem Bey....

464
00:44:31,395 --> 00:44:34,015
Batur Alp, who appears to be guilty...

465
00:44:34,045 --> 00:44:35,905
had brought gold to the tribe.

466
00:44:35,915 --> 00:44:41,465
This proves that he is acting on
orders from Öktem Bey.

467
00:44:43,865 --> 00:44:49,015
Öktem Bey's hands are stained with the
blood of all those innocents.

468
00:44:51,675 --> 00:44:56,295
The punishment for such a crime can
only be the death penalty.

469
00:44:56,525 --> 00:44:58,325
Execution.

470
00:45:10,595 --> 00:45:13,345
Thank Allah, we are believers.

471
00:45:15,705 --> 00:45:17,435
Goodness comes from Allah.

472
00:45:19,925 --> 00:45:21,695
And evil is from Allah.

473
00:45:30,365 --> 00:45:32,245
Of course.

474
00:45:33,345 --> 00:45:35,775
The court is now over.

475
00:46:05,415 --> 00:46:09,615
Tradition leaves the place
when injustice enters it.

476
00:46:11,475 --> 00:46:14,345
It's over, Osman Bey.

477
00:46:15,195 --> 00:46:19,015
You have no justice or tradition left

478
00:46:59,600 --> 00:47:02,960
Search the place, don't let
anyone breathe.

479
00:47:03,080 --> 00:47:05,080
Cut off the heads of the dead.

480
00:47:25,800 --> 00:47:27,550
Bring the horses.

481
00:47:30,840 --> 00:47:32,540
Horses will carry the golds.

482
00:47:35,770 --> 00:47:38,320
I have a more important job now.

483
00:47:48,790 --> 00:47:52,550
The horse is for the one who rides it
and the sword is for the one who wears it.

484
00:47:52,570 --> 00:47:54,570
That gold will not be yours.

485
00:47:54,790 --> 00:47:57,770
Will my Bey leave them for the others?

486
00:47:58,950 --> 00:48:02,380
Come on, let's go and tell Bayındır Bey.

487
00:48:13,330 --> 00:48:15,630
I smell blood already.

488
00:48:15,740 --> 00:48:17,740
Olof will have a chance for revenge.

489
00:48:20,960 --> 00:48:24,280
And now it's time for me to be Frigg.

490
00:48:35,580 --> 00:48:37,670
I admire your justice
very much, Osman Bey.

491
00:48:37,990 --> 00:48:39,840
You haven't seen anything yet.

492
00:48:49,080 --> 00:48:50,340
Speak.

493
00:48:50,490 --> 00:48:54,540
My Bey, they raided the caravan that was
carrying gold to Constantinople.

494
00:48:57,170 --> 00:48:59,650
Delivering the gold was my mission.

495
00:48:59,900 --> 00:49:02,700
Osman Bey, I will go and find.

496
00:49:02,700 --> 00:49:03,900
No.

497
00:49:04,890 --> 00:49:07,370
You can not move on
my land without my knowledge.

498
00:49:10,970 --> 00:49:13,220
If we're going, we'll go together.

499
00:49:17,390 --> 00:49:18,760
Alps!

500
00:49:19,360 --> 00:49:21,260
Get ready!

501
00:49:33,390 --> 00:49:34,630
The court is over.

502
00:49:34,670 --> 00:49:36,670
They will execute our Öktem Bey.

503
00:49:38,470 --> 00:49:40,550
They expelled Alçiçek Hatun from her land.

504
00:49:41,290 --> 00:49:45,360
It's time, Beys.

505
00:49:51,160 --> 00:49:52,960
What are you doing?

506
00:49:53,130 --> 00:49:55,320
The consequences of what
you're doing are big.

507
00:49:55,350 --> 00:49:57,020
It signifies a civil war.

508
00:49:57,040 --> 00:49:59,040
It's over, Turgut Bey.

509
00:49:59,540 --> 00:50:01,550
The swords came out of their sheaths.

510
00:50:01,600 --> 00:50:03,600
The knife touched the bone.

511
00:50:04,310 --> 00:50:09,040
You are our captive until we rescue
Öktem Bey from that dungeon.

512
00:50:09,590 --> 00:50:12,290
Do you intend to make the brothers fight?

513
00:50:13,170 --> 00:50:16,990
If something like that happens,
I won't leave you unpunished.

514
00:50:17,420 --> 00:50:19,240
And I will not spare you, Uraz Bey.

515
00:50:19,470 --> 00:50:20,820
Arrest him.

516
00:50:33,930 --> 00:50:37,460
It's time for revenge, Beys.

517
00:50:38,180 --> 00:50:40,400
We'll go and rescue Öktem Bey.

518
00:50:40,540 --> 00:50:41,860
Come on.

519
00:50:42,140 --> 00:50:44,210
What you're doing is not right, Beys.

520
00:50:44,570 --> 00:50:47,120
The enemies are not here, they
are on the border.

521
00:50:47,120 --> 00:50:48,500
They are looking for
a mess.

522
00:50:48,520 --> 00:50:50,410
You make Turks fight among themselves

523
00:50:50,420 --> 00:50:52,120
Don't do this.

524
00:50:56,580 --> 00:50:58,200
Osman is heading towards the trap.

525
00:50:59,290 --> 00:51:01,240
And gold is with us

526
00:51:04,540 --> 00:51:08,120
But the first victim of the
civil war will be Turgut.

527
00:51:56,350 --> 00:51:58,700
Alps, look everywhere.

528
00:51:59,160 --> 00:52:01,410
Don't come back before
you find a trace.

529
00:52:11,310 --> 00:52:16,520
My Bey, the ones who stole the gold
are the same ones who raided the Macri.

530
00:52:17,880 --> 00:52:21,180
They took the horses and
gold towards Iznik.

531
00:52:21,660 --> 00:52:25,680
What your eyes have seen undoes all knots.

532
00:52:26,150 --> 00:52:30,450
But we need those knots now.

533
00:52:31,540 --> 00:52:33,520
It makes us earn money.

534
00:52:36,710 --> 00:52:40,610
But, my Bey, the enemies are not the
ones we are used to.

535
00:52:40,720 --> 00:52:42,720
We have to give them a good game.

536
00:52:45,450 --> 00:52:48,000
The issue is about gold, Hüseyin.

537
00:52:48,160 --> 00:52:50,460
I will plan such a game that...

538
00:52:50,740 --> 00:52:54,670
Satan will come and ask us for advice.

539
00:52:57,200 --> 00:52:59,380
Planning games is easy, Hüseyin.

540
00:53:02,430 --> 00:53:04,650
That gold will be mine.

541
00:53:05,720 --> 00:53:07,800
I won't let anyone take it.

542
00:53:07,990 --> 00:53:09,650
I will not leave it to anyone.

543
00:53:09,670 --> 00:53:11,670
Come on, get my horse!

544
00:53:31,750 --> 00:53:33,800
From this side, Osman Bey.

545
00:53:50,770 --> 00:53:52,890
Same horse traces...

546
00:53:53,320 --> 00:53:55,470
But it is deeper.

547
00:53:56,150 --> 00:53:58,250
They put gold on the horses...

548
00:53:58,350 --> 00:54:00,350
And they went in that direction.

549
00:54:04,580 --> 00:54:06,980
You're pulling us toward
a trap, aren't you?

550
00:54:10,820 --> 00:54:15,400
But you will be the one who gets caught
despite knowing about the trap.

551
00:54:27,670 --> 00:54:29,650
I admire your intelligence, Osman.

552
00:54:31,600 --> 00:54:35,150
Yes, I set a trap for you.

553
00:54:36,290 --> 00:54:39,040
But we have come to the
end of the road now.

554
00:54:39,110 --> 00:54:43,780
The path of those who take the sun as a
banner and the sky as a tent doesn't end.

555
00:54:45,000 --> 00:54:48,020
Judge Dursun is charged with
making a decision based on the evidence.

556
00:54:48,150 --> 00:54:52,000
But those enemies who
put that evidence there...

557
00:54:54,550 --> 00:54:56,620
I will find them and cut off their hands.

558
00:55:04,100 --> 00:55:05,950
- Judge Dursun.
- My Bey.

559
00:55:06,080 --> 00:55:10,660
What I want from you is to postpone the
execution of the sentence until I come.

560
00:55:20,770 --> 00:55:23,350
Inshallah, I will find the guilty ones
and bring them.

561
00:55:25,160 --> 00:55:27,210
Then, justice will be served.

562
00:55:27,790 --> 00:55:29,370
Thank you, my Bey.

563
00:55:29,490 --> 00:55:31,490
Thank you.

564
00:55:41,540 --> 00:55:43,890
Wind!

565
00:55:45,270 --> 00:55:47,520
Bring my black curse

566
00:56:11,440 --> 00:56:13,210
It's over, Osman.

567
00:56:13,410 --> 00:56:14,750
It's over.

568
00:56:15,470 --> 00:56:17,470
The balance of your justice is spoiled.

569
00:56:18,260 --> 00:56:20,380
It was not Öktem who
raided the village...

570
00:56:20,720 --> 00:56:21,920
it was me.

571
00:56:22,690 --> 00:56:24,360
I'm the one who shot Aktemur.

572
00:56:25,540 --> 00:56:27,990
Look, you're alone.

573
00:56:30,300 --> 00:56:32,180
Now I will kill you too.

574
00:56:33,700 --> 00:56:36,320
And then I will burn Yenisehir.

575
00:56:36,390 --> 00:56:39,170
You can't burn anything.

576
00:56:41,540 --> 00:56:45,970
As for me, I will enjoy
spoiling the traps.

577
00:56:56,940 --> 00:56:58,170
Turgut.

578
00:57:04,615 --> 00:57:07,515
I am Aladdin, son of the Ghazi Osman Bey.

579
00:57:08,665 --> 00:57:10,655
I came here by order of him.

580
00:57:10,785 --> 00:57:12,785
And my words are his words.

581
00:57:13,575 --> 00:57:16,235
You have to trust what
I'm going to tell you now.

582
00:57:17,735 --> 00:57:20,975
Osman Bey believes Öktem Bey.

583
00:57:21,265 --> 00:57:24,535
And I made a game to reveal the truth.

584
00:57:24,875 --> 00:57:26,685
And I need your help.

585
00:57:28,485 --> 00:57:32,795
After the trial is over, Öktem Bey
will walk towards a trap.

586
00:57:33,845 --> 00:57:36,215
And he will leave his Alps in Yenişehir.

587
00:57:36,425 --> 00:57:39,985
So Olof will think he has put
Osman Bey into the trap he set.

588
00:57:40,575 --> 00:57:44,135
And I will go with Öktem Bey's Alps
to help Osman Bey.

589
00:57:44,965 --> 00:57:47,715
To catch that dog named Olof.

590
00:57:48,515 --> 00:57:50,105
Beys.

591
00:57:52,105 --> 00:57:54,695
The end of those
who try to divide us...

592
00:57:57,005 --> 00:57:59,045
will be
through our union together, Inshallah.

593
00:57:59,275 --> 00:58:00,775
Inshallah.

594
00:58:01,535 --> 00:58:03,235
And now, Beys...

595
00:58:03,385 --> 00:58:04,925
are you with us?

596
00:58:04,975 --> 00:58:06,975
We are with you, Aladdin Bey.

597
00:58:08,535 --> 00:58:09,815
Thank you.

598
00:58:17,505 --> 00:58:18,865
Orhan.

599
00:58:32,315 --> 00:58:33,705
Bala.

600
00:58:38,485 --> 00:58:41,015
Whoever does something, he
must bear the consequences

601
00:58:41,065 --> 00:58:43,065
Come on, sisters.

602
00:58:54,745 --> 00:58:56,075
Bala.

603
00:59:03,415 --> 00:59:04,755
Orhan.

604
00:59:20,825 --> 00:59:22,545
Surrender or...

605
00:59:24,005 --> 00:59:26,505
be a Muslim and take refuge
in our justice.

606
00:59:29,955 --> 00:59:31,485
Or fight.

607
00:59:31,925 --> 00:59:34,495
I cursed you, Osman.

608
00:59:47,865 --> 00:59:49,455
Alps!

609
00:59:50,025 --> 00:59:53,565
Hit the chests of the infidels
for the sake of Allah.

610
00:59:53,985 --> 00:59:55,985
O Allah!

611
00:59:56,505 --> 00:59:58,025
Attack!

612
01:00:53,895 --> 01:00:55,545
You dishonorable!

613
01:03:20,745 --> 01:03:23,775
We'll live today for the
revenge we'll get later.

614
01:03:23,785 --> 01:03:25,065
We have to go.

615
01:03:25,125 --> 01:03:26,925
No, Frigg, no!

616
01:03:26,945 --> 01:03:28,555
Olof, not today.

617
01:03:28,675 --> 01:03:29,905
Not today, Olof.

618
01:03:29,935 --> 01:03:31,935
I will kill him!

619
01:03:32,895 --> 01:03:34,865
Let's go, let's go.

620
01:03:36,275 --> 01:03:37,515
Withdraw!

621
01:03:37,575 --> 01:03:39,575
Withdraw!

622
01:03:43,795 --> 01:03:45,125
Saruza!

623
01:03:45,175 --> 01:03:46,555
Come on.

624
01:03:55,005 --> 01:03:57,055
You finally demolished my tent.

625
01:03:57,515 --> 01:03:59,165
But I won't leave it here.

626
01:03:59,235 --> 01:04:01,655
I'll make you pay the price!

627
01:04:01,725 --> 01:04:03,725
Easy, Hatun!

628
01:04:05,055 --> 01:04:06,915
I'm trying to understand your pain...

629
01:04:06,925 --> 01:04:09,525
but enough is enough.

630
01:04:09,575 --> 01:04:11,175
My patience has limits too.

631
01:04:11,205 --> 01:04:13,205
I have no patience, Hatun.

632
01:04:14,885 --> 01:04:18,205
You want to execute my husband and take
my only daughter away from me.

633
01:04:18,645 --> 01:04:20,715
You upset a mother.

634
01:04:20,835 --> 01:04:23,375
You will never get rid of my curse.

635
01:04:23,685 --> 01:04:25,195
Bengi Hatun.

636
01:04:25,385 --> 01:04:28,305
You say something you'll regret later.

637
01:04:28,445 --> 01:04:30,165
Don't think I'll stop.

638
01:04:30,525 --> 01:04:32,315
I swear...

639
01:04:32,335 --> 01:04:35,175
I will not let my husband and
daughter become your victim.

640
01:04:36,785 --> 01:04:38,155
Patience!

641
01:04:56,385 --> 01:04:58,225
- Mother!
- My Çiçek! (flower)

642
01:05:00,485 --> 01:05:02,065
My beautiful daughter.

643
01:05:11,125 --> 01:05:12,625
Why are you laughing?

644
01:05:12,745 --> 01:05:14,475
What happened?

645
01:05:15,975 --> 01:05:19,735
We knew Öktem Bey and
Alçiçek were innocent.

646
01:05:20,545 --> 01:05:22,415
What are you saying, Malhun Hatun?

647
01:05:22,475 --> 01:05:25,735
Osman Bey had trusted Öktem Bey
from the start.

648
01:05:26,565 --> 01:05:28,915
In order for the truth to be revealed to all...

649
01:05:29,085 --> 01:05:31,375
he's deceiving Olof.

650
01:05:32,495 --> 01:05:34,075
What about the court?

651
01:05:34,105 --> 01:05:37,195
The verdict? They're
building the gallows outside.

652
01:05:37,495 --> 01:05:39,765
When Osman Bey reveals the truth...

653
01:05:39,835 --> 01:05:42,165
the verdict of the court will
be overturned, mother.

654
01:05:42,205 --> 01:05:44,225
Our innocence will be known.

655
01:05:49,365 --> 01:05:51,255
When the trial is over...

656
01:05:51,855 --> 01:05:53,925
the men were going to rebel.

657
01:05:54,695 --> 01:05:57,235
The news will have reached them
a long time ago, Bey.

658
01:05:58,325 --> 01:06:01,495
What have you done, Hatun?
What have you done?

659
01:06:03,415 --> 01:06:05,435
We knew this too, Bengi Hatun.

660
01:06:05,485 --> 01:06:07,545
I knew you wouldn't stand still.

661
01:06:08,095 --> 01:06:09,905
You didn't trust Osman Bey...

662
01:06:09,925 --> 01:06:11,125
and you didn't wait.

663
01:06:11,215 --> 01:06:13,395
You listened to the devil and disobeyed.

664
01:06:13,465 --> 01:06:15,465
How should I know, Malhun Hatun?

665
01:06:15,815 --> 01:06:18,095
What would you do if you
were me?

666
01:06:18,505 --> 01:06:20,975
If they took your husband and daughter...

667
01:06:21,125 --> 01:06:22,705
I would have been patient, Hatun.

668
01:06:22,835 --> 01:06:24,835
I would trust Osman Bey.

669
01:06:26,245 --> 01:06:28,305
The thing you did was a civil war.

670
01:06:28,365 --> 01:06:30,365
You would make brothers fight each other.

671
01:06:32,805 --> 01:06:34,365
Alçiçek.

672
01:06:35,275 --> 01:06:37,405
Take good care of your mother.

673
01:06:37,845 --> 01:06:42,045
See what happens
if you don't control your anger.

674
01:06:43,895 --> 01:06:46,375
You are right, Malhun Hatun.

675
01:06:48,355 --> 01:06:50,745
Hatun acted recklessly.

676
01:06:52,815 --> 01:06:54,325
Forgive her

677
01:06:56,735 --> 01:06:58,065
Don't worry.

678
01:07:01,125 --> 01:07:02,925
We should pray for...

679
01:07:03,945 --> 01:07:07,965
...Osman Bey to throw off Olof's mask.

680
01:07:08,605 --> 01:07:10,695
What if that dog doesn't rise to the bait?

681
01:07:11,495 --> 01:07:13,375
What will we do then?

682
01:07:15,565 --> 01:07:17,445
Are you going to walk to your death?

683
01:07:18,805 --> 01:07:21,305
Give me patience, Allah.

684
01:07:47,625 --> 01:07:48,965
My Bey!

685
01:07:52,940 --> 01:07:55,480
My Bey!
Olof is running to the fortress.

686
01:07:55,680 --> 01:07:57,060
What shall we do?

687
01:07:57,740 --> 01:07:59,280
We know where he is.

688
01:07:59,900 --> 01:08:01,680
We'll hit him when it's time.

689
01:08:03,870 --> 01:08:05,500
Let's go.

690
01:08:12,190 --> 01:08:15,270
Marmaracik Castle

691
01:08:20,790 --> 01:08:22,140
Who are you?

692
01:08:22,210 --> 01:08:23,540
Olof

693
01:08:23,620 --> 01:08:25,140
Commander Olof.

694
01:08:35,390 --> 01:08:36,979
Who are you running from?

695
01:08:37,040 --> 01:08:38,880
I don't run away from anyone.

696
01:08:39,800 --> 01:08:42,399
I am only surviving for vengeance.

697
01:08:57,340 --> 01:08:59,279
I am here in the name of the emperor

698
01:08:59,680 --> 01:09:01,520
Put down your spears.

699
01:09:16,380 --> 01:09:18,368
Increase precautions around the castle.

700
01:09:19,840 --> 01:09:21,170
Now!

701
01:09:26,990 --> 01:09:29,200
Yenisehir

702
01:09:33,285 --> 01:09:34,825
Come in, dear.

703
01:09:42,585 --> 01:09:46,274
The good news has come, thank Allah
you are free now.

704
01:09:47,095 --> 01:09:50,875
Olof confessed his all betrayals.

705
01:09:54,850 --> 01:09:58,620
Certainly the day will come when
he will be punished for his actions.

706
01:09:58,830 --> 01:10:00,900
Insha'Allah.

707
01:10:01,940 --> 01:10:04,940
Rest assured, Bengi Hatun.

708
01:10:05,870 --> 01:10:07,700
Have a rest now.

709
01:10:12,885 --> 01:10:18,665
Daughter, bring me some water, will you?

710
01:10:27,185 --> 01:10:28,775
Hatun!

711
01:10:30,135 --> 01:10:32,635
Tell me now.

712
01:10:33,975 --> 01:10:37,835
What do you think you did by
gathering the Beys and rebel?

713
01:10:38,035 --> 01:10:39,825
How could you do this?

714
01:10:40,205 --> 01:10:44,785
I did everything to protect you
and my daughter.

715
01:10:44,855 --> 01:10:46,805
How could I know
that Osman had a game?

716
01:10:46,885 --> 01:10:50,775
I trusted him and surrendered myself,
you should have trusted me too, Hatun!

717
01:10:50,845 --> 01:10:54,805
But no, you just can't keep calm can you?!

718
01:10:54,925 --> 01:10:56,245
I always told you to...

719
01:10:56,335 --> 01:11:00,105
...keep your anger under control!

720
01:11:00,505 --> 01:11:02,565
Is this all my fault now, Oktem Bey?

721
01:11:02,695 --> 01:11:04,035
What are you talking about?

722
01:11:04,175 --> 01:11:05,695
What if there was no game?

723
01:11:05,785 --> 01:11:09,125
Should I have watched your death
while they hang you?

724
01:11:09,255 --> 01:11:10,585
No!

725
01:11:10,655 --> 01:11:12,745
I would do the same thing again!

726
01:11:12,825 --> 01:11:14,905
You are still stubborn, Hatun!

727
01:11:15,015 --> 01:11:16,465
Stop already!

728
01:11:16,675 --> 01:11:20,915
You threw me, my tribe and my alps
in danger, don't you see?

729
01:11:21,035 --> 01:11:23,275
- You are going too far Oktem Bey!
- Shut up!

730
01:11:26,575 --> 01:11:28,575
Don't say a word.

731
01:11:31,055 --> 01:11:35,525
I can die, Hatun.
But my tribe will stay!

732
01:11:36,165 --> 01:11:42,595
From now on, nothing will be done
without my knowledge.

733
01:12:02,425 --> 01:12:05,235
You will remember these words, Oktem Bey.

734
01:12:06,255 --> 01:12:08,085
You will remember it.

735
01:12:09,915 --> 01:12:15,925
You'll remember this talk when Osman
stabs you in the back again.

736
01:12:16,865 --> 01:12:19,345
I'll be by your side that day too.

737
01:12:20,135 --> 01:12:23,905
But when that day comes...

738
01:12:24,325 --> 01:12:29,725
...I will remind you of these words
one by one, Oktem Bey.

739
01:12:33,985 --> 01:12:37,185
Huseyin, you said the cavalry will
come first, you are sure, right?

740
01:12:37,895 --> 01:12:40,115
Here they are, my Bey

741
01:12:46,635 --> 01:12:48,715
Come to me.

742
01:12:49,395 --> 01:12:51,985
Bring me my gold.

743
01:12:55,725 --> 01:12:58,235
Shall we shoot arrows, my Bey?

744
01:12:58,255 --> 01:12:59,625
Wait.

745
01:13:06,765 --> 01:13:09,735
- Now, my Bey?
- Wait!

746
01:13:13,095 --> 01:13:14,925
We should shoot now my Bey!

747
01:13:15,645 --> 01:13:16,985
Right now!

748
01:13:24,645 --> 01:13:30,445
Let's go Alps, their bodies belong
to the ground, their gold belongs to us.

749
01:14:14,935 --> 01:14:20,125
None of you will survive!

750
01:14:43,205 --> 01:14:44,745
Look at this!

751
01:14:46,525 --> 01:14:49,025
Check that out, Huseyin!

752
01:14:49,535 --> 01:14:51,895
They are shining like sun!

753
01:14:55,265 --> 01:15:00,575
But these shine better than sun does!
Am I right, Huseyin?

754
01:15:01,085 --> 01:15:02,955
Like you said, my Bey.

755
01:15:05,555 --> 01:15:09,125
Come on, don't leave any trace behind.

756
01:15:09,295 --> 01:15:11,395
Load the chest.

757
01:15:11,725 --> 01:15:16,325
Let's go back before they
realise what happened.

758
01:15:46,135 --> 01:15:48,355
Justice will be served.

759
01:15:49,155 --> 01:15:50,745
As you see.

760
01:15:52,375 --> 01:15:55,305
The real guilties are here.

761
01:16:09,465 --> 01:16:13,115
If you want to keep your secret hidden
even from the enemy...

762
01:16:13,115 --> 01:16:16,085
...you should never talk about it
to anyone, even to a friend.

763
01:16:19,635 --> 01:16:25,555
This is why I didn't tell you earlier,
Oktem Bey.

764
01:16:25,645 --> 01:16:27,795
Forgive us.

765
01:16:32,405 --> 01:16:34,175
What can I say, Osman Bey.

766
01:16:36,635 --> 01:16:40,355
We repeat the same
thing from the beginning.

767
01:16:40,635 --> 01:16:44,165
I give you my blessings.

768
01:16:47,205 --> 01:16:49,305
Thank you Osman Bey.

769
01:16:50,685 --> 01:16:53,235
However, delayed justice is not justice.

770
01:16:58,515 --> 01:16:59,985
Bengi Hatun.

771
01:17:01,495 --> 01:17:04,725
It was late and difficult.

772
01:17:05,295 --> 01:17:07,755
We needed to play by their rules.

773
01:17:08,895 --> 01:17:10,415
What did what we had to.

774
01:17:11,075 --> 01:17:12,775
Eyvallah (okay)

775
01:17:13,455 --> 01:17:17,195
I give you my blessings.

776
01:17:18,855 --> 01:17:20,395
Judge Dursun.

777
01:17:22,245 --> 01:17:23,465
My Bey.

778
01:17:23,835 --> 01:17:26,165
You always decide according to the evidence.

779
01:17:26,245 --> 01:17:29,425
Here you see the real criminals.

780
01:17:32,275 --> 01:17:34,775
Olof is their head.

781
01:17:35,545 --> 01:17:37,345
And these are his toys.

782
01:17:37,695 --> 01:17:39,665
They ended many lives.

783
01:17:39,875 --> 01:17:41,535
They shall be punished.

784
01:17:42,745 --> 01:17:45,275
The scales of justice weighed
the wrong side, my Bey.

785
01:17:47,405 --> 01:17:53,665
After punishing these traitors,
the scales of justice will be balanced.

786
01:17:55,025 --> 01:17:57,685
Olof is our enemy.

787
01:17:58,295 --> 01:18:00,705
The place where he's hiding is Marmaracik.

788
01:18:01,455 --> 01:18:07,085
We will not stop until we make it our land
where the enemy hides.

789
01:18:10,595 --> 01:18:12,095
Alps!

790
01:18:26,745 --> 01:18:30,095
I'll wait for you at my table when
the sun goes down

791
01:18:31,325 --> 01:18:35,215
We will forget our pain
and remember our martyrs

792
01:18:36,515 --> 01:18:39,345
We'll talk about
our new plans.

793
01:18:39,515 --> 01:18:41,705
Eyvallah my Bey, Eyvallah (sure).

794
01:19:06,955 --> 01:19:09,395
Give me your blessings, Oktem Bey.

795
01:19:09,715 --> 01:19:11,895
You too, Judge Dursun.

796
01:19:12,055 --> 01:19:13,425
I do.

797
01:19:19,435 --> 01:19:22,265
Yenişehir, Osman Bey's mansion.

798
01:19:27,955 --> 01:19:30,685
How dexterous you are!

799
01:19:31,015 --> 01:19:35,365
Do you think I can't cook because
I'm a fighter, Ulgen Hatun?

800
01:19:35,805 --> 01:19:38,355
My father loves my meals the most.

801
01:19:38,635 --> 01:19:40,785
Praise be!

802
01:19:41,905 --> 01:19:44,105
He must have missed your meals.

803
01:19:45,205 --> 01:19:47,445
Whoever marries you
will live longer, girl!

804
01:19:53,365 --> 01:19:55,725
How is it going, Hatuns?

805
01:19:56,665 --> 01:19:58,645
Get out of here now!

806
01:19:59,465 --> 01:20:03,745
Ayse Hatun is about to come.
She will burn us!

807
01:20:11,535 --> 01:20:13,655
How is it going, Alcicek Hatun?

808
01:20:15,345 --> 01:20:17,515
Thank you, Subasi.

809
01:20:18,005 --> 01:20:19,685
For everything.

810
01:20:23,055 --> 01:20:26,395
Slow down, slow down my Bey!

811
01:20:27,545 --> 01:20:30,745
If you are too thirsty,
just toss the whole bottle.

812
01:20:39,565 --> 01:20:41,755
You were right, Subasi.

813
01:20:42,325 --> 01:20:44,705
Osman Bey was always with us.

814
01:20:46,135 --> 01:20:48,175
Now it's all over.

815
01:20:48,635 --> 01:20:50,735
Don't think about this anymore.

816
01:21:01,865 --> 01:21:04,485
How is your wound, Subasi?

817
01:21:06,235 --> 01:21:10,725
So will you keep calling me Subasi,
Cicek Hatun?

818
01:21:13,115 --> 01:21:16,685
My name is Alcicek, Subasi!

819
01:21:17,525 --> 01:21:18,895
You still do it.

820
01:21:24,545 --> 01:21:26,875
Aktemur!

821
01:21:39,855 --> 01:21:44,255
Are you still hovering around my son?

822
01:21:44,885 --> 01:21:46,245
Mother!

823
01:21:47,405 --> 01:21:49,515
The truth came out.

824
01:21:50,045 --> 01:21:51,595
Alcicek is innocent.

825
01:21:51,825 --> 01:21:54,165
- Stop it.
- Stop what?

826
01:21:54,325 --> 01:21:56,685
Didn't this girl stab you?

827
01:22:00,635 --> 01:22:05,435
How can you still
look at this young man's face?

828
01:22:05,595 --> 01:22:08,125
Don't you ever feel guilty?

829
01:22:13,755 --> 01:22:14,925
I...

830
01:22:15,855 --> 01:22:17,705
It was an accident.

831
01:22:18,685 --> 01:22:23,665
Satan was also innocent before
he turned into Satan.

832
01:22:25,095 --> 01:22:30,985
You will only cause misfortune for my son.

833
01:22:31,285 --> 01:22:34,445
Stay away from my son.

834
01:22:46,185 --> 01:22:50,315
I am telling you that's enough, mother!

835
01:22:50,765 --> 01:22:52,505
You are going too far!

836
01:22:55,255 --> 01:22:58,015
Didn't I tell you not to see this girl again?

837
01:22:58,175 --> 01:22:59,405
The more...

838
01:23:02,125 --> 01:23:06,675
The more I let you,
the further you go, mother!

839
01:23:13,345 --> 01:23:14,875
Aktemur!

840
01:23:32,375 --> 01:23:35,135
Leave it, leave it.

841
01:23:35,365 --> 01:23:38,995
This wound will revive my vengeance.

842
01:23:39,995 --> 01:23:44,765
Don't tie it up, it will bleed and heal.

843
01:23:47,635 --> 01:23:56,515
I swear to you, I will make Osman's
head a banner over this castle.

844
01:23:58,835 --> 01:24:00,615
We'll do it together.

845
01:24:01,635 --> 01:24:03,915
We'll do it together darling.

846
01:24:09,585 --> 01:24:11,365
Bad news!

847
01:24:13,615 --> 01:24:16,365
The men I gave the gold
were ambushed.

848
01:24:24,185 --> 01:24:25,385
What about the gold?

849
01:24:28,485 --> 01:24:31,535
They stole the gold and
killed our men, Olof.

850
01:24:54,685 --> 01:24:58,185
No! No!

851
01:25:13,785 --> 01:25:15,335
Osman Bey.

852
01:25:15,335 --> 01:25:19,335
If you continue to keep me a prisoner,
I will consider it a reason for war.

853
01:25:19,635 --> 01:25:22,255
Is this how you react to the man
who saved your life?

854
01:25:23,435 --> 01:25:25,785
Olof came to the court today.

855
01:25:25,785 --> 01:25:27,785
He was constantly asking about you.

856
01:25:28,215 --> 01:25:30,535
And set a trap on the way to Yenisehir.

857
01:25:30,765 --> 01:25:32,535
You were the target.

858
01:25:34,585 --> 01:25:36,335
I shielded you from his wrath.

859
01:25:37,535 --> 01:25:39,265
And what about the court?

860
01:25:39,265 --> 01:25:41,265
Oktem Bey has been acquitted.

861
01:25:43,515 --> 01:25:45,785
Olof is the one who set the whole game.

862
01:25:48,185 --> 01:25:50,415
Why would Olof do something like this?

863
01:25:50,415 --> 01:25:53,035
I don't want to hear your lies anymore.

864
01:25:53,035 --> 01:25:55,565
You'll believe me when he ambushes you.

865
01:25:55,935 --> 01:25:59,425
You became his enemy when he found out
that you tried to accuse him.

866
01:26:00,665 --> 01:26:03,415
Why would you still not believe me?

867
01:26:05,385 --> 01:26:07,485
Don't be surprised, Kantakuzenos.

868
01:26:08,015 --> 01:26:09,765
Do not be surprised.

869
01:26:09,865 --> 01:26:11,635
Are you sure of this?

870
01:26:11,635 --> 01:26:13,635
He is the one who came to my land.

871
01:26:13,935 --> 01:26:16,465
He's the one who collaborated
with Frigg and Ophelia.

872
01:26:16,985 --> 01:26:21,565
He and Frigg were even fighting shoulder
to shoulder today.

873
01:26:21,665 --> 01:26:24,465
I must tell this to the Emperor at onceç

874
01:26:24,465 --> 01:26:26,465
I know.

875
01:26:26,635 --> 01:26:28,935
And tell him that my Beys are innocent.

876
01:26:31,415 --> 01:26:33,935
Tell my friend Andrinakos that...

877
01:26:34,235 --> 01:26:38,365
He has three days to give me Olof's head.

878
01:26:39,385 --> 01:26:41,885
Otherwise, the friendship will end.

879
01:26:42,435 --> 01:26:45,115
I will not be responsible for what happens.

880
01:26:45,315 --> 01:26:47,815
I came here for peace, Osman Bey.

881
01:26:47,815 --> 01:26:49,535
I will do whatever it takes

882
01:26:49,535 --> 01:26:50,835
Of course you will.

883
01:26:50,935 --> 01:26:53,515
Otherwise, you will be run over
under Turks' horses.

884
01:26:54,315 --> 01:26:58,315
Rome is neither too small to be run over
under your horses...

885
01:26:58,385 --> 01:27:00,185
...nor this is necessary.

886
01:27:00,635 --> 01:27:01,965
Excuse me.

887
01:27:01,965 --> 01:27:03,965
Have a good travel.

888
01:27:19,485 --> 01:27:22,335
Do you think the truth will come out
when he arrives in Constantinople?

889
01:27:23,105 --> 01:27:24,805
There are two possibilities.

890
01:27:25,585 --> 01:27:28,155
If he gives us Olof's head in three days...

891
01:27:28,705 --> 01:27:31,255
...this means that Kantakuzenos is innocent.

892
01:27:32,535 --> 01:27:34,335
But if he does not...

893
01:27:34,635 --> 01:27:36,705
...I will bury them both in the same grave.

894
01:27:38,055 --> 01:27:43,105
Whether he worked with Olof or not,
we see the poison in him Osman Bey.

895
01:27:43,555 --> 01:27:45,375
He's looking for someone to bite.

896
01:27:46,135 --> 01:27:49,005
We carry our weapons to crush
the heads of those snakes.

897
01:27:49,355 --> 01:27:50,735
Let him try.

898
01:27:51,735 --> 01:27:53,105
Eyvallah.

899
01:28:14,250 --> 01:28:16,050
Why did we stop, princess?

900
01:28:16,500 --> 01:28:18,700
What's my job here, Sarkis?

901
01:28:32,800 --> 01:28:35,550
What if they kill my father, Sarkis?

902
01:28:36,700 --> 01:28:39,170
I should not have left Konstantinople.

903
01:28:39,750 --> 01:28:41,170
I needed to stay and fight!

904
01:28:43,920 --> 01:28:45,690
If that wasn't the only solution...

905
01:28:46,600 --> 01:28:49,950
...I would have done everything to stay,
princess.

906
01:28:50,800 --> 01:28:53,920
However, we just couldn't get into a war
in which we will lose.

907
01:28:54,950 --> 01:28:57,470
Besides, your father would be
on the other side.

908
01:29:19,270 --> 01:29:20,570
Atttack!

909
01:30:40,150 --> 01:30:41,470
Sarkis!

910
01:30:41,500 --> 01:30:43,670
Hang on princess.

911
01:30:48,400 --> 01:30:50,420
Ride the horse and run away, princess!

912
01:30:50,420 --> 01:30:51,900
I won't go without you Sarkis.

913
01:30:51,900 --> 01:30:53,300
Ride the horse, princess.

914
01:31:02,470 --> 01:31:03,920
You stupid!

915
01:31:06,170 --> 01:31:07,900
Aims like a stupid!

916
01:31:07,900 --> 01:31:10,620
I'll do it myself!

917
01:31:50,370 --> 01:31:52,420
To the horses, run!

918
01:32:07,550 --> 01:32:08,870
Princess!

919
01:32:08,870 --> 01:32:10,870
Princess, hold on!

920
01:32:11,020 --> 01:32:12,870
We're about to get rid of them.

921
01:32:12,870 --> 01:32:15,620
I can't go on any longer Sarkis.

922
01:32:16,300 --> 01:32:18,320
We have to keep going, princess.

923
01:32:26,250 --> 01:32:27,750
I promise I will save you.

924
01:32:27,750 --> 01:32:29,300
Come on princess.

925
01:32:31,850 --> 01:32:33,700
Come on! Come on!

926
01:32:33,800 --> 01:32:35,550
Catch them!

927
01:32:35,550 --> 01:32:36,720
Faster!

928
01:32:39,720 --> 01:32:41,800
You'll find out who did this, Frigg.

929
01:32:42,270 --> 01:32:46,300
You will find the ones who stole my gold
and pull my wrath towards themselves.

930
01:32:46,920 --> 01:32:48,420
You will find them.

931
01:32:48,750 --> 01:32:51,650
So that I'll tear them apart.

932
01:32:52,950 --> 01:32:54,320
No.

933
01:32:55,120 --> 01:32:57,270
Odin left me in the middle of the road.

934
01:32:57,620 --> 01:33:01,350
Now I will walk with the devil!

935
01:33:01,350 --> 01:33:03,350
The devil has come, Olof!

936
01:33:14,500 --> 01:33:18,370
My brother from another mother.

937
01:33:25,170 --> 01:33:28,520
Who wouldn't want a demon brother
while fighting Osman?

938
01:33:29,450 --> 01:33:32,750
I will begin the great war when I
reach Constantinople.

939
01:33:32,750 --> 01:33:34,750
About time!

940
01:33:34,750 --> 01:33:36,750
First they captured me

941
01:33:37,550 --> 01:33:40,600
And then they attacked Marmaracik.

942
01:33:41,300 --> 01:33:43,400
And the heroic leader Olof...

943
01:33:44,350 --> 01:33:46,350
...repelled that attack.

944
01:33:46,350 --> 01:33:52,700
So Emperor's huge army will
attack Osman.

945
01:34:13,670 --> 01:34:16,000
- Hold on Princess.
- Sarkis.

946
01:34:27,170 --> 01:34:28,540
Sarkis.

947
01:34:28,570 --> 01:34:30,570
You will be fine, princess.

948
01:34:30,570 --> 01:34:32,120
You'll be fine.

949
01:34:32,170 --> 01:34:33,900
We'll get out of here.

950
01:34:51,720 --> 01:34:53,520
My Bey, we have been attacked.

951
01:34:53,520 --> 01:34:55,820
We are in the mine in Saraga.

952
01:35:07,600 --> 01:35:08,950
Go!

953
01:35:15,500 --> 01:35:17,070
Come on princess.

954
01:35:17,070 --> 01:35:19,070
We must cauterize your wound.

955
01:35:19,850 --> 01:35:21,150
Hold on.

956
01:35:32,950 --> 01:35:34,450
Search around.

957
01:35:40,920 --> 01:35:42,950
Stop it!

958
01:36:09,450 --> 01:36:11,000
Foolish.

959
01:36:12,020 --> 01:36:15,020
You think Osman Bey will save you?

960
01:36:18,350 --> 01:36:20,350
If Osman is coming here...

961
01:36:20,350 --> 01:36:22,350
Olof will definitely want to to catch him.

962
01:36:22,450 --> 01:36:24,250
Go tell Olof right now.

963
01:36:24,250 --> 01:36:25,750
We are here.

964
01:36:25,750 --> 01:36:28,570
We'll wait by the cave, hurry up!

965
01:37:00,050 --> 01:37:02,370
If an Alp did what you did...

966
01:37:04,000 --> 01:37:06,100
...I would derank him and exile him.

967
01:37:08,970 --> 01:37:10,870
But you are my blood.

968
01:37:23,550 --> 01:37:25,700
Someone from us...

969
01:37:26,550 --> 01:37:29,120
...should never fall into such a negligence.

970
01:37:30,950 --> 01:37:33,450
You are my brother's trophy.

971
01:37:34,570 --> 01:37:36,750
This mission is what
your father left for you.

972
01:37:38,620 --> 01:37:40,150
Aktemur.

973
01:37:42,370 --> 01:37:43,710
Don't you dare.

974
01:37:45,500 --> 01:37:47,830
There is no forgiveness for the mistake
I did.

975
01:37:50,430 --> 01:37:52,150
I neglected my job.

976
01:37:53,310 --> 01:37:54,660
My Bey.

977
01:37:56,620 --> 01:37:58,810
Cancel my title Subasi.

978
01:38:02,920 --> 01:38:04,460
Come here.

979
01:38:05,230 --> 01:38:08,490
And now you're hiding behind your mistake
and giving up your title?

980
01:38:09,030 --> 01:38:10,590
Aktemur!

981
01:38:11,920 --> 01:38:13,800
I did not remove your title.

982
01:38:44,840 --> 01:38:46,570
Is your wound bandaged?

983
01:38:53,520 --> 01:38:55,410
That wound can be bandaged.

984
01:38:57,760 --> 01:38:59,810
But the wound caused by disappointing you...

985
01:38:59,810 --> 01:39:01,620
I'm not talking about that wound.

986
01:39:02,110 --> 01:39:04,130
I'm talking about the wound in your heart.

987
01:39:08,260 --> 01:39:09,770
That wound...

988
01:39:13,210 --> 01:39:14,740
That wound is deep.

989
01:39:14,930 --> 01:39:17,200
So is love.

990
01:39:20,500 --> 01:39:22,270
If it wasn't love...

991
01:39:23,940 --> 01:39:25,810
...you wouldn't do such a mistake.

992
01:39:27,440 --> 01:39:29,280
Does she love you too?
Tell me.

993
01:39:30,580 --> 01:39:32,350
I don't know uncle.

994
01:39:33,420 --> 01:39:35,180
You should know, you should.

995
01:39:35,790 --> 01:39:38,800
You should know it when you
look at her in the eye.

996
01:39:41,180 --> 01:39:46,590
So make yourself sure
and inform me.

997
01:39:50,500 --> 01:39:52,340
Then we will ask her for marriage.

998
01:40:05,220 --> 01:40:07,990
Do not forget that the slap was for
your negligence.

999
01:40:11,200 --> 01:40:13,280
Don't make this mistake again.

1000
01:40:14,570 --> 01:40:16,370
That wound on your shoulder...

1001
01:40:17,580 --> 01:40:21,070
It will be the wound of your love that
you'll never forget for the rest of your life

1002
01:40:28,360 --> 01:40:30,400
I will never forget any of them, my Bey.

1003
01:40:33,770 --> 01:40:35,090
Any of them.

1004
01:40:50,150 --> 01:40:52,700
Why do you always come to my mind, Subasi?

1005
01:41:10,140 --> 01:41:12,170
How is it going, Alcicek Hatun.

1006
01:41:14,060 --> 01:41:15,430
Thank you.

1007
01:41:21,860 --> 01:41:24,380
Do you have a problem?
You look so distracted.

1008
01:41:30,320 --> 01:41:32,160
You say no, but..

1009
01:41:33,360 --> 01:41:35,800
But your eyes say something
else, Alcicek Hatun.

1010
01:41:38,480 --> 01:41:40,710
Do you know what your eyes remind me of?

1011
01:41:42,190 --> 01:41:46,640
In the tribe I was born in,
I used to wake up before everyone else.

1012
01:41:47,580 --> 01:41:49,130
I would go to hunting.

1013
01:41:50,150 --> 01:41:51,740
The green herbs...

1014
01:41:52,320 --> 01:41:54,200
And the leaves on the trees...

1015
01:41:55,400 --> 01:41:57,990
They all had dew drops on
them in the morning.

1016
01:41:59,700 --> 01:42:01,710
Look, it's just like your eyes

1017
01:42:02,700 --> 01:42:05,260
Dew drops are beautiful
on the leaves and herbs.

1018
01:42:05,670 --> 01:42:07,220
...beautiful but...

1019
01:42:08,770 --> 01:42:11,280
If it is because of the sadness...

1020
01:42:12,700 --> 01:42:14,710
...for every drop of dew...

1021
01:42:15,840 --> 01:42:17,900
...I'll burn the whole forest.

1022
01:42:20,890 --> 01:42:23,390
Come on, tell me.

1023
01:42:23,620 --> 01:42:25,450
What is the thing that tears your eyes?

1024
01:42:26,360 --> 01:42:27,880
Let me heal it.

1025
01:42:30,480 --> 01:42:32,260
These are tears of joy.

1026
01:42:34,000 --> 01:42:35,550
Thank Allah.

1027
01:42:35,680 --> 01:42:37,810
My father and I have been proven innocent.

1028
01:42:38,090 --> 01:42:40,090
Troubled times have passed.

1029
01:42:40,770 --> 01:42:44,640
I hope your eyes never shed
tears of sadness, Alcicek Hatun.

1030
01:42:45,550 --> 01:42:47,710
Always have tears of joy.

1031
01:42:51,720 --> 01:42:53,730
Excuse me, Uncle Bayindir.

1032
01:42:54,360 --> 01:42:55,520
I am in a hurry.

1033
01:43:04,300 --> 01:43:06,320
Constantinople
Emperor's Palace

1034
01:43:45,385 --> 01:43:47,105
They killed the soldiers!

1035
01:43:47,395 --> 01:43:49,425
And they took our gold!

1036
01:43:50,455 --> 01:43:52,995
And now they attacked Marmaracik, huh?

1037
01:43:53,155 --> 01:43:55,195
Fortunately the hero Olof was there.

1038
01:43:55,535 --> 01:43:56,985
He repelled the attack.

1039
01:43:57,455 --> 01:44:00,185
How dare Osman do this?

1040
01:44:00,715 --> 01:44:03,425
How dare he poison me with my daughter!?

1041
01:44:04,435 --> 01:44:06,965
How dare he comes in my palace
and saves me?

1042
01:44:07,475 --> 01:44:09,555
How dare he captures you?

1043
01:44:11,685 --> 01:44:13,255
Your weakness.

1044
01:44:16,285 --> 01:44:17,955
Because of your weakness, Emperor.

1045
01:44:21,435 --> 01:44:23,765
He became the hero for you
after he saved you.

1046
01:44:25,455 --> 01:44:27,075
He took everything he wanted.

1047
01:44:28,145 --> 01:44:30,235
You are the one who gave him this courage.

1048
01:44:31,655 --> 01:44:32,735
Emperor.

1049
01:44:33,595 --> 01:44:36,115
I beg you not to be weak.

1050
01:44:37,865 --> 01:44:40,585
Kill those who got you into this trap.

1051
01:44:41,495 --> 01:44:42,955
Rome has this power.

1052
01:44:44,445 --> 01:44:46,455
Rome has never been so small!

1053
01:44:47,405 --> 01:44:49,165
It won't get any smaller!

1054
01:44:50,125 --> 01:44:51,445
Kantakuzenos.

1055
01:44:52,315 --> 01:44:54,035
Send your soldiers to Olof.

1056
01:44:54,825 --> 01:44:58,585
And kill Ophelia whose blood is my blood!

1057
01:44:59,615 --> 01:45:00,715
Immediately!

1058
01:45:08,215 --> 01:45:10,385
Marmaracik Castle

1059
01:45:38,355 --> 01:45:39,655
You all.

1060
01:45:44,255 --> 01:45:49,435
Don't you take off your shields even inside
the walls, Commander Olof?

1061
01:45:50,045 --> 01:45:51,605
Moreover...

1062
01:45:52,745 --> 01:45:54,525
While eating.

1063
01:45:55,335 --> 01:45:56,895
I sleep in the armor.

1064
01:45:58,325 --> 01:45:59,665
Commander, Remus!

1065
01:46:01,965 --> 01:46:06,405
You can't know when the enemy
stabs you.

1066
01:46:12,035 --> 01:46:13,755
Why are you here?

1067
01:46:14,165 --> 01:46:16,045
Is this a question to ask a guest?

1068
01:46:28,695 --> 01:46:32,275
How long will I host you?

1069
01:46:46,645 --> 01:46:48,385
Until we erase Osman.

1070
01:46:55,775 --> 01:46:58,285
Only the brave deserve to live!

1071
01:47:00,745 --> 01:47:03,595
Are you brave?

1072
01:47:11,425 --> 01:47:13,955
As long as this coward is on your head...

1073
01:47:15,075 --> 01:47:16,695
You will not be brave!

1074
01:47:18,145 --> 01:47:20,425
Osman knocks on your doors!

1075
01:47:22,135 --> 01:47:24,675
And you're sitting here useless!

1076
01:47:28,895 --> 01:47:32,935
But you will also be brave, my brothers!

1077
01:47:45,355 --> 01:47:46,685
I'm not your enemy!

1078
01:47:48,035 --> 01:47:49,925
I am your new leader.

1079
01:47:51,345 --> 01:47:53,405
Now put your swords in their sheaths.

1080
01:47:53,885 --> 01:47:55,905
You will need it when Osman comes.

1081
01:47:59,015 --> 01:48:01,445
And you will be brave, brother.

1082
01:48:03,195 --> 01:48:07,135
Olof is an obedient leader of Rome.

1083
01:48:07,885 --> 01:48:09,065
From now on...

1084
01:48:10,375 --> 01:48:11,935
You are under his command.

1085
01:48:22,455 --> 01:48:26,635
Loyalty is measured by the wisdom
you display in front of your enemy.

1086
01:48:29,275 --> 01:48:32,495
Death to the enemies of Rome!

1087
01:48:32,615 --> 01:48:36,435
Death to the enemies of Rome!

1088
01:48:36,625 --> 01:48:40,705
Death to the enemies of Rome!

1089
01:48:41,025 --> 01:48:43,155
Death to the enemies of Rome!

1090
01:48:46,695 --> 01:48:48,785
One of those kidnapped Ophelia...

1091
01:48:49,635 --> 01:48:53,195
and you know him.

1092
01:48:56,035 --> 01:48:57,195
He hasn't spoken yet.

1093
01:49:00,335 --> 01:49:01,815
But he will speak.

1094
01:49:03,105 --> 01:49:05,455
I personally will make him speak.

1095
01:49:23,285 --> 01:49:24,825
They found Ophelia.

1096
01:49:25,745 --> 01:49:27,245
I'll go and kill her.

1097
01:49:27,865 --> 01:49:31,205
Commander Remus, wait for me here.

1098
01:49:47,275 --> 01:49:49,135
Yenisehir

1099
01:49:50,985 --> 01:49:52,755
The fog has dissipated.

1100
01:49:52,785 --> 01:49:54,165
We beat our enemies.

1101
01:49:54,895 --> 01:49:56,395
Thank Allah my father!

1102
01:49:57,825 --> 01:49:59,375
Now tell me!

1103
01:50:00,025 --> 01:50:02,605
What lesson did you take from
what happened today?

1104
01:50:03,405 --> 01:50:06,145
The enemy does not fight
only with weapons, my Bey.

1105
01:50:06,725 --> 01:50:08,615
They spread sedition and immorality.

1106
01:50:08,865 --> 01:50:11,925
But the one who has the will
and maintains the unity...

1107
01:50:12,205 --> 01:50:13,955
He wins all the battle.

1108
01:50:16,505 --> 01:50:19,955
You cannot tell which side
your enemy is on.

1109
01:50:20,795 --> 01:50:23,285
For this reason,
our eyes should always be open.

1110
01:50:23,815 --> 01:50:25,655
As you should know, father, that...

1111
01:50:25,655 --> 01:50:27,585
Whether the sheath is full or empty.

1112
01:50:27,645 --> 01:50:29,325
Praise be!

1113
01:50:30,365 --> 01:50:33,215
You should always be like this as one body.

1114
01:50:35,425 --> 01:50:38,375
If one of you catches something,
the other will shoot.

1115
01:50:39,425 --> 01:50:42,195
You will so that
before the oppressor raises his head...

1116
01:50:42,775 --> 01:50:45,335
...you'll cut their breath.

1117
01:50:46,285 --> 01:50:49,515
But it is not enough just to hit the enemy.

1118
01:50:51,845 --> 01:50:54,045
The union inside must be maintained too.

1119
01:50:54,505 --> 01:50:56,225
And the biggest enemy...

1120
01:50:57,115 --> 01:50:58,615
....is sedition.

1121
01:50:59,035 --> 01:51:01,405
As long as we don't give it a chance
to occur...

1122
01:51:01,405 --> 01:51:04,645
...The blessed Islamic call
will last forever.

1123
01:51:07,025 --> 01:51:09,055
Who is spreading sedition, father?

1124
01:51:10,305 --> 01:51:12,195
Satan spreads it, my daughter.

1125
01:51:12,485 --> 01:51:13,815
Satan.

1126
01:51:13,995 --> 01:51:18,185
That Satan sows the seeds of
hypocrisy among brothers.

1127
01:51:18,785 --> 01:51:20,675
It separates them from each other.

1128
01:51:24,595 --> 01:51:27,365
They have to hold on to the rope of Allah.

1129
01:51:27,815 --> 01:51:30,375
They need to secure each other's back.

1130
01:51:30,865 --> 01:51:32,605
But they usually fall into oblivion.

1131
01:51:32,675 --> 01:51:35,705
And they remain naked
in front of the arrows of the enemy.

1132
01:51:36,625 --> 01:51:38,715
But as long as we are united...

1133
01:51:39,085 --> 01:51:43,095
..we will revive the cause of exalting
the word of Allah forever.

1134
01:51:45,835 --> 01:51:51,355
Praise be to Allah, our children
carry the love of Islam in their heart.

1135
01:51:51,445 --> 01:51:54,965
They are willing to put
up with anything for this.

1136
01:51:58,125 --> 01:52:03,605
Our dawah will spread like an arrow
through our children and grandchildren.

1137
01:52:03,835 --> 01:52:06,015
And we will become more powerful
than the mountains, Inshallah!

1138
01:52:07,405 --> 01:52:08,945
Insha'Allah.

1139
01:52:12,345 --> 01:52:13,915
Insha'Allah.

1140
01:52:20,585 --> 01:52:23,725
- Brother, are you hungry?
- Like a wolf, brother!

1141
01:52:23,825 --> 01:52:25,585
I'm hungry too!

1142
01:52:25,695 --> 01:52:30,175
Let's go to the kitchen then.
I wanted such a supper from Ulgen Hatun!

1143
01:52:30,275 --> 01:52:32,185
Are we eating liver today, brother?

1144
01:52:32,505 --> 01:52:36,175
- There must be halva too, right?
- Yes.

1145
01:52:36,265 --> 01:52:40,665
First one to go to the kitchen
eats two plates of halva!

1146
01:52:43,945 --> 01:52:45,505
Let's go brother.

1147
01:53:16,005 --> 01:53:17,775
Cerkutay Alp!

1148
01:53:19,575 --> 01:53:21,305
Cerkutay Alp!

1149
01:53:24,225 --> 01:53:28,835
Oh man!
Did you eat it all?

1150
01:53:29,275 --> 01:53:33,455
I gave him three plates of meal
to protect your food from him!

1151
01:53:33,600 --> 01:53:35,200
He is never full.

1152
01:53:43,355 --> 01:53:46,915
Cerkutay Alp.
Cerkutay Alp.

1153
01:53:48,405 --> 01:53:49,925
How will we wake him up?

1154
01:53:50,535 --> 01:53:51,955
He does not hear us.

1155
01:53:53,005 --> 01:53:57,065
He eats our food and does not hear us!
What will we eat now?

1156
01:53:57,545 --> 01:54:01,595
Wait a minute! We should teach
Cerkutay Alp a lesson.

1157
01:54:01,985 --> 01:54:05,715
We should also open his ears!
Shouldn't we, Fatima?

1158
01:54:08,285 --> 01:54:10,195
I'll be right back.

1159
01:54:15,305 --> 01:54:18,815
- What are you doing Ulgen Hatun?
- Desperate diseases have desperate remedies.

1160
01:54:19,215 --> 01:54:22,015
Only drums can open Cerkutay Alp's ears!

1161
01:54:22,165 --> 01:54:26,025
Come on, each of you grab a plate,
bowl, or whatever you can find!

1162
01:54:37,165 --> 01:54:38,955
Are you ready?

1163
01:54:39,505 --> 01:54:41,305
Come on, come on, valiants!

1164
01:54:42,945 --> 01:54:45,965
Attack, my Bey!

1165
01:54:47,565 --> 01:54:48,945
My Bey!

1166
01:54:51,425 --> 01:54:53,205
What are you doing?

1167
01:54:55,135 --> 01:55:00,185
We were playing my new song.
Its name is "you don't hear".

1168
01:55:02,065 --> 01:55:04,205
You don't hear?

1169
01:55:06,655 --> 01:55:08,595
Do you hear us?

1170
01:55:09,335 --> 01:55:11,775
Oh did it work?

1171
01:55:12,105 --> 01:55:13,895
Do you hear me?

1172
01:55:16,275 --> 01:55:21,055
I don't hear you, I don't hear you!

1173
01:55:21,275 --> 01:55:25,815
I don't hear, I don't hear, I don't hear you!

1174
01:55:26,135 --> 01:55:30,145
No my Bey, I don't hear you!

1175
01:55:30,405 --> 01:55:33,665
Cerkutay doesn't hear!

1176
01:55:35,545 --> 01:55:37,045
He doesn't hear!

1177
01:55:45,705 --> 01:55:47,855
No, I wo... I don't hear!

1178
01:55:48,235 --> 01:55:50,795
Cerkutay doesn't hear!

1179
01:55:57,985 --> 01:56:00,075
In the name of of Allah
the Merciful, the Compassionate.

1180
01:56:02,815 --> 01:56:04,615
Enjoy it.

1181
01:56:05,545 --> 01:56:07,125
In the name of Allah.

1182
01:56:15,245 --> 01:56:16,765
Here, daughter.

1183
01:56:23,515 --> 01:56:27,545
Justice has been served
thanks to you, Osman Bey.

1184
01:56:28,365 --> 01:56:32,945
And despite what we lived, you host
us at your table, may Allah bless you.

1185
01:56:40,815 --> 01:56:47,125
We couldn't realise the big picture.
We disobeyed, we are sorry Osman Bey.

1186
01:56:48,105 --> 01:56:52,765
When it comes to children,
the eyes of mothers goes blind.

1187
01:56:55,105 --> 01:56:59,405
I ignore what you did,
considering that you are a mother.

1188
01:57:02,305 --> 01:57:04,575
Your tribe has been through
a difficult test.

1189
01:57:07,405 --> 01:57:12,375
You must not be led by your anger
and make such a mistake again.

1190
01:57:16,795 --> 01:57:19,365
There is justice in these lands.

1191
01:57:20,785 --> 01:57:24,685
No one should attempt to
achieve justice on their own.

1192
01:57:29,095 --> 01:57:31,035
Isn't that right, my daughter, Alcicek?

1193
01:57:40,515 --> 01:57:42,185
Just like you said, Osman Bey.

1194
01:57:43,395 --> 01:57:44,985
Allah bless you.

1195
01:57:47,025 --> 01:57:50,495
You stood by us in this
difficult situation and supported us.

1196
01:57:52,395 --> 01:57:54,945
Challanges are not over yet.

1197
01:57:55,995 --> 01:57:58,285
We are after a huge case.

1198
01:57:58,685 --> 01:58:03,015
There will be many difficult challanges
in the way of this dawah.

1199
01:58:03,925 --> 01:58:08,635
We have to trust each other
and support each other.

1200
01:58:09,945 --> 01:58:11,785
We will support each other so that...

1201
01:58:12,805 --> 01:58:17,895
We can build a strong country together.

1202
01:58:24,095 --> 01:58:28,145
Let's finish our meals first, Oktem Bey,
and then I'll have a talk with you.

1203
01:58:28,395 --> 01:58:30,095
Eyvallah my Bey.

1204
01:58:36,255 --> 01:58:37,355
My Bey.

1205
01:58:39,455 --> 01:58:42,115
Allow me to check on my mother.

1206
01:59:23,015 --> 01:59:27,175
Who are you, knocking like a payee?
Do you know what time is it?

1207
01:59:40,115 --> 01:59:44,805
Give me the cloth the Beys wear.

1208
01:59:46,005 --> 01:59:49,265
We don't work at this hour.
Come tomorrow, please.

1209
01:59:52,115 --> 01:59:55,285
Aren't you the best seller here,
Hatun?

1210
01:59:57,815 --> 01:59:59,345
I am.

1211
02:00:06,405 --> 02:00:08,655
I think you should not
miss the opportunity.

1212
02:00:09,235 --> 02:00:13,345
Give me of the finest fabrics,
and I will shower you with gold.

1213
02:00:15,155 --> 02:00:17,095
Let me see the gold first.

1214
02:00:19,295 --> 02:00:22,805
I need to see if it is worth
waking me up from my sleep.

1215
02:00:31,715 --> 02:00:33,815
You must be very rich.

1216
02:00:34,905 --> 02:00:38,285
Why do you ask?
Just mind your gold!

1217
02:00:56,245 --> 02:00:59,655
Here, a fabric for me!

1218
02:01:00,175 --> 02:01:05,265
Prepare it by tomorrow.
I'll come and pick it up.

1219
02:01:05,925 --> 02:01:07,875
Consider it done.

1220
02:01:57,465 --> 02:02:01,545
We have found the trail of the spy of
Osman and Ophelia.

1221
02:02:04,245 --> 02:02:07,545
And I think I found the gold.

1222
02:02:09,295 --> 02:02:12,045
Will you carry me through
the Sirat Bridge?

1223
02:02:13,465 --> 02:02:17,125
It's like you showered in the
rivers of paradise.

1224
02:02:23,115 --> 02:02:25,055
We couldn't catch, my Bey.

1225
02:02:31,905 --> 02:02:34,245
Looks like you've come from
a very tough road.

1226
02:02:37,285 --> 02:02:38,605
From far away.

1227
02:02:41,685 --> 02:02:44,705
You're coming from overseas.

1228
02:02:46,735 --> 02:02:48,505
It seems you are angry.

1229
02:02:50,705 --> 02:02:52,805
But its not because of the
distance of the way.

1230
02:02:58,175 --> 02:02:59,895
You stumbled.

1231
02:03:01,925 --> 02:03:04,495
You dropped your load.

1232
02:03:12,355 --> 02:03:14,545
Do you still have anything to carry?

1233
02:03:23,665 --> 02:03:25,995
What is that, Kumral Abdal?

1234
02:03:37,155 --> 02:03:39,765
You're Konuralp's horse!

1235
02:03:41,735 --> 02:03:43,985
Oh Allah, protect him.

1236
02:03:46,805 --> 02:03:48,815
Inform my Bey at once!

1237
02:03:48,885 --> 02:03:51,565
- Oguz Alp, give water to the horse.
- Yes my Bey.

1238
02:03:51,655 --> 02:03:54,575
Hurry up get the water, hurry up!

1239
02:03:56,555 --> 02:04:01,845
All those valiants died for something.
They died for our dawah.

1240
02:04:02,455 --> 02:04:05,065
But I told you when I gave you
the location of the black tree.

1241
02:04:05,325 --> 02:04:09,765
It's next door to Macri and
we would conquer there too.

1242
02:04:10,155 --> 02:04:12,175
Yes my Bey, you told me that

1243
02:04:12,795 --> 02:04:16,925
You've gone through a lot, Oktem Bey.
But it's all worth it.

1244
02:04:17,215 --> 02:04:20,795
The road is tough and we
already need a tough Bey.

1245
02:04:21,915 --> 02:04:25,215
You have been very patient,
may Allah bless you.

1246
02:04:26,975 --> 02:04:30,775
The one who shoots in hurry
misses the greater prays, my Bey.

1247
02:04:31,395 --> 02:04:35,565
I fought for many years in these lands.

1248
02:04:37,065 --> 02:04:43,175
I have buried many valiants.
Yet I still haven't tasted the martyrdom.

1249
02:04:45,055 --> 02:04:47,415
This path taught us about patience, my Bey.

1250
02:04:49,725 --> 02:04:53,365
This road will take us to Marmaracik.

1251
02:04:54,125 --> 02:04:57,175
It will also be difficult,
but we will be patient

1252
02:04:59,055 --> 02:05:02,655
- Our job has never been easy.
- Yes.

1253
02:05:05,485 --> 02:05:07,555
Can I come in my Bey?

1254
02:05:08,695 --> 02:05:10,625
Come!

1255
02:05:22,065 --> 02:05:26,435
Excuse us, Oktem Bey.

1256
02:05:27,485 --> 02:05:29,545
Eyvallah my Bey.

1257
02:05:35,015 --> 02:05:36,265
Tell me.

1258
02:05:36,415 --> 02:05:37,795
My Bey.

1259
02:05:37,955 --> 02:05:40,755
Konur and Ophelia are caught
in a trap while coming to Yenişehir.

1260
02:05:41,315 --> 02:05:43,055
They are asking for help

1261
02:05:43,255 --> 02:05:46,775
They are in Saraca, they are hiding
in the mine there.

1262
02:05:57,985 --> 02:06:00,805
Aktemur, keep the control of Yenisehir.

1263
02:06:01,395 --> 02:06:02,805
I'll go with the alps.

1264
02:06:03,495 --> 02:06:04,805
Your command, my Bey.

1265
02:06:18,085 --> 02:06:20,355
Ayse Hatun looked very well.

1266
02:06:22,225 --> 02:06:25,865
When did she get so sick that she can't
come to the dining table?

1267
02:06:31,925 --> 02:06:36,275
Isn't it time to end this tension
between you two, Bengi Hatun?

1268
02:06:37,075 --> 02:06:40,435
And look, the good and the bad
have turned out.

1269
02:06:42,185 --> 02:06:44,785
Am I the only one causing the tension,
Bala Hatun?

1270
02:06:47,155 --> 02:06:51,865
She humiliated my daughter
in the middle of the market!

1271
02:06:52,885 --> 02:06:57,795
You're right Bengi Hatun,
but we also know what you did too.

1272
02:06:58,185 --> 02:07:01,475
You must apologise to Ayse Hatun.

1273
02:07:03,185 --> 02:07:04,485
Why?

1274
02:07:05,825 --> 02:07:08,135
I spoke what needed to be spoken.

1275
02:07:08,135 --> 02:07:10,345
I don't regret my words.

1276
02:07:10,935 --> 02:07:14,935
Look, I'm here, but she doesn't dare to
appear in front of me.

1277
02:07:22,465 --> 02:07:26,565
Who are you to question my courage?

1278
02:07:29,395 --> 02:07:32,295
Maybe I just don't want to
get involved with dirt.

1279
02:07:32,775 --> 02:07:35,975
Hatuns, come back to your senses!

1280
02:07:37,205 --> 02:07:38,565
Ayse Hatun.

1281
02:07:40,215 --> 02:07:43,955
Bengi Hatun is our guest.
Be silent.

1282
02:07:45,495 --> 02:07:48,745
You raised a very spoiled son, Hautn.

1283
02:07:49,745 --> 02:07:52,325
She stabbed him, so what?

1284
02:07:54,185 --> 02:07:55,775
He didn't die.

1285
02:07:55,875 --> 02:07:57,605
- You...
- Ayse!

1286
02:08:00,265 --> 02:08:01,795
Bengi Hatun.

1287
02:08:03,735 --> 02:08:05,275
Watch your words!

1288
02:08:05,525 --> 02:08:07,075
Both are our children!

1289
02:08:08,745 --> 02:08:12,055
This issue is now closed!

1290
02:08:18,545 --> 02:08:20,135
Excuse me.

1291
02:08:30,435 --> 02:08:32,975
You humiliated me to the world of Turks!

1292
02:08:33,785 --> 02:08:39,825
I will divide this mansion into two
seperate pieces!

1293
02:09:09,085 --> 02:09:12,805
I came to get your liver out of your mouth!

1294
02:09:13,595 --> 02:09:15,485
Osman's mouse!

1295
02:09:15,485 --> 02:09:19,355
Osman?
What does he mean, Sarkis?

1296
02:09:20,105 --> 02:09:22,685
Didn't he tell you his real name?

1297
02:09:24,585 --> 02:09:29,135
He was going to take you to Osman Bey,
wasn't he?

1298
02:09:31,535 --> 02:09:33,655
Osman's loyal spy.

1299
02:09:34,745 --> 02:09:37,075
Did you deceive me too, Sarkis?

1300
02:09:37,115 --> 02:09:40,425
- I'll tell you everything, princess.
- You won't be able to.

1301
02:09:42,045 --> 02:09:44,625
You won't have a head left to speak.

1302
02:09:44,775 --> 02:09:46,285
Infidel!

1303
02:09:48,295 --> 02:09:49,595
Come.

1304
02:10:12,155 --> 02:10:13,355
Stop!

1305
02:10:15,595 --> 02:10:16,905
Stop!

1306
02:10:17,175 --> 02:10:20,005
You want me! Take me!

1307
02:10:20,415 --> 02:10:22,965
We already have you, princess.

1308
02:10:26,015 --> 02:10:27,815
Take her to Marmaracik.

1309
02:10:29,095 --> 02:10:30,955
I will wait for Osman.

1310
02:10:31,755 --> 02:10:34,775
- No leave me!
- I will be your hell, Olof!

1311
02:10:34,855 --> 02:10:36,045
Let go of me!

1312
02:10:36,845 --> 02:10:39,945
Sarkis! Sarkis!

1313
02:10:41,785 --> 02:10:44,205
You trust Osman Bey, don't you?

1314
02:10:44,605 --> 02:10:48,235
He will come and save you from here.

1315
02:11:04,775 --> 02:11:08,125
You're wondering why
I didn't kill you, right?

1316
02:11:10,425 --> 02:11:15,785
Live until he comes,
because you will kill Osman.

1317
02:11:36,925 --> 02:11:39,545
Yes Malhun Hatun, I am listening to you.

1318
02:11:40,375 --> 02:11:44,765
Alcicek, I'll ask this once and directly.

1319
02:11:46,335 --> 02:11:49,595
You know Aktemur is in love with you,
don't you?

1320
02:11:54,055 --> 02:11:56,105
What is this about, Malhun Hatun?

1321
02:11:58,585 --> 02:12:00,465
Don't you know?

1322
02:12:03,815 --> 02:12:07,875
Did you not understand looking
him in the eye...

1323
02:12:08,475 --> 02:12:12,015
...while even I realised it
watching you for once from a distance?

1324
02:12:13,975 --> 02:12:15,295
No.

1325
02:12:16,605 --> 02:12:18,165
I didn't realise.

1326
02:12:19,865 --> 02:12:22,455
Also, what do I have to do with this?

1327
02:12:23,645 --> 02:12:26,235
I was sad because
I accidentally stabbed him.

1328
02:12:28,555 --> 02:12:33,965
Will I love him because
I grieved and regretted?

1329
02:12:35,305 --> 02:12:39,615
I saw you both in the market today,
and you didn't seem like what you say.

1330
02:12:41,055 --> 02:12:43,635
You assessed it the
wrong way, Malhun Hatun.

1331
02:12:44,955 --> 02:12:49,415
I am not in love with
Aktemur or anyone else.

1332
02:13:20,905 --> 02:13:23,165
Brother!
Konur!

1333
02:13:23,535 --> 02:13:25,055
Hold this.

1334
02:13:25,385 --> 02:13:26,745
Brother!

1335
02:13:27,865 --> 02:13:29,195
Brother!

1336
02:13:33,275 --> 02:13:36,985
Hold on a little more!

1337
02:13:39,025 --> 02:13:41,095
Marmaracik Castle

1338
02:13:59,150 --> 02:14:01,960
I don't like crying girls, princess.

1339
02:14:05,100 --> 02:14:06,990
I hate princesses.

1340
02:14:25,710 --> 02:14:28,300
I hate creatures like you.

1341
02:14:38,140 --> 02:14:40,710
Do you hate your beloved father too?

1342
02:14:45,260 --> 02:14:47,900
Is that why you tried to kill the emperor?

1343
02:14:53,970 --> 02:14:56,500
You have no advantage but being a princess.

1344
02:15:01,820 --> 02:15:03,540
And you can't fight.

1345
02:15:09,070 --> 02:15:11,570
The day you tried to kill your fathe...

1346
02:15:14,960 --> 02:15:17,260
...you gave up being a princess too

1347
02:15:44,610 --> 02:15:48,690
You will die being a traitor before
you can explain yourself.

1348
02:15:50,130 --> 02:15:51,710
This is very sad.

1349
02:16:40,799 --> 02:16:43,330
Do not tire yourself.

1350
02:16:45,780 --> 02:16:49,420
- My Bey.
- This will pass, hang on.

1351
02:16:54,700 --> 02:16:56,290
Alps!

1352
02:16:57,920 --> 02:16:59,299
Hang on.

1353
02:17:00,000 --> 02:17:03,150
Hang on, hang on.

1354
02:17:06,200 --> 02:17:07,540
My Bey.

1355
02:17:07,620 --> 02:17:08,930
Brother!

1356
02:17:09,980 --> 02:17:11,718
Hang on

1357
02:17:29,580 --> 02:17:31,170
Alps!

1358
02:17:32,218 --> 02:17:33,790
Alps!

1359
02:17:36,840 --> 02:17:47,520
Please contact turkision@gmail.com for any inquiries